WEBVTT

00:00:59.684 --> 00:01:03.437
Long time no see, everyone!
Without further ado--

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:07.942
Let's toast to the success of
Cafe Zero 2, my new restaurant!

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:10.820
--Cheers!
--Cheers!

00:01:12.154 --> 00:01:15.741
Who would have guessed that
Tamaki had such a flair for business?

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.704
The place being named what it is,
| was wondering what he was doing.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:21.747
Yeah, really.

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:24.584
Hmm, what could the matter be?

00:01:24.792 --> 00:01:28.004
Does he need changing?
There's some open space on the second floor.

00:01:28.212 --> 00:01:32.049
That's all right. He's just
a little cranky. Aren't you?

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:34.010
Oh, okay. In that case...

00:01:34.218 --> 00:01:35.428
Ohgi...

00:01:35.636 --> 00:01:36.220
Yes?

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:39.682
Why did you step down as prime minister?
Was your apathy--

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:43.561
This guy here is just fainthearted, you see!

00:01:43.769 --> 00:01:48.649
A small-timer! He's not
cut out for that sort of thing!

00:01:48.858 --> 00:01:50.401
What is he doing?

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:52.236
Isn't this nice?

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:56.532
It's because we're at peace that we could
get so many of us together like it was nothing.

00:01:56.741 --> 00:01:57.992
Mm-hmm.

00:02:08.085 --> 00:02:09.545
It is the second year of the Kowa Era.

00:02:09.754 --> 00:02:15.092
A year has passed since the treacherous
Emperor Lelouch was killed by Zero.

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:18.888
The world was celebrating
an unprecedented peace,

00:02:19.096 --> 00:02:22.141
centered around the reorganized
United Federation of Nations.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:27.563
This year would come to be known
in later years as the "Miraculous Tomorrow,"

00:02:27.772 --> 00:02:30.399
a time in human history
with neither war nor terrorism.

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:32.985
However,

00:02:33.194 --> 00:02:37.198
if conflict is one of the
fundamental essences of humanity,

00:02:37.406 --> 00:02:41.702
it is safe to say that those days
would inevitably come to an end.

00:02:41.911 --> 00:02:45.831
Very well. I will consult with
the legislature to see if the refugees

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:49.752
can be taken in by the
Principality of Britannia.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:54.757
However, right now, I have no authority
to make governmental decisions.

00:02:54.965 --> 00:02:58.511
| will try to accommodate them
as quickly as possible,

00:02:58.719 --> 00:03:01.764
--It's me. Who are the approaching Knightmare Frames attached to?
--but it would be very helpful to have the rest of you work with me.

00:03:01.764 --> 00:03:05.685
--It's me. Who are the approaching Knightmare Frames attached to?
--Also, any shortages of food or medicine are--

00:03:07.937 --> 00:03:08.688
Terrorists!

00:03:08.896 --> 00:03:11.816
Get the honorary consultant inside! Hurry!

00:03:21.409 --> 00:03:23.911
You can't! This is strictly ceremonial!
It's unarmed!

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.871
The float system is disconnected!

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:28.207
This is the only unit
that can move out right now.

00:03:28.416 --> 00:03:29.709
I'm just going to buy some time.

00:03:30.876 --> 00:03:33.295
--What is this?
--This is supposed to be a demilitarized zone!

00:03:35.297 --> 00:03:38.300
They're breaking a
whole year of continuous peace.

00:03:39.343 --> 00:03:41.721
The peace that Lelouch left us!

00:03:49.186 --> 00:03:51.480
There may be a lot of noise,

00:03:51.689 --> 00:03:53.023
but I can take them!

00:04:04.076 --> 00:04:08.330
Zero is something special, all right.
Just as big sister prophesied.

00:04:11.333 --> 00:04:15.171
Zero, one other unit approaching,
but we have no corresponding data on it.

00:04:15.379 --> 00:04:18.048
Got it. I'll capture it and--

00:04:18.257 --> 00:04:20.176
If only I had a sandboard...

00:04:23.679 --> 00:04:26.640
Ha! Just as big sister prophesied!

00:04:29.143 --> 00:04:33.939
What is this doing here?! Oh, no!
| don't have enough thrust!

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:40.863
This is an emergency bulletin.

00:04:41.071 --> 00:04:43.699
While inspecting a refugee camp,
Nunnally vi Britannia,

00:04:43.908 --> 00:04:47.703
the honorary consultant for WHA,
the World Humanitarian Agency,

00:04:47.912 --> 00:04:50.080
along with the chief adviser
for the Black Knights...

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:56.170
Yeah, it's been over a year since
Jeremiah took us in, hasn't it?

00:04:56.378 --> 00:04:58.464
| want to thank you for
what you did back then, Shirley.

00:04:58.672 --> 00:05:01.759
You were the only one
able to move freely about.

00:05:01.967 --> 00:05:03.636
It's just...

00:05:05.721 --> 00:05:09.266
Oh, you heard about that from Anya.

00:05:11.227 --> 00:05:15.147
There's a gateway left that Charles hasn't touched.

00:05:15.356 --> 00:05:18.067
| think I'll go and check it out.

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:29.203
Why does this world

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:36.168
lead me on

00:05:36.377 --> 00:05:41.006
and then shake me off?

00:05:47.096 --> 00:05:50.766
Why does the world

00:05:52.351 --> 00:05:57.565
harrow up my heart

00:05:57.773 --> 00:06:02.778
again and again?

00:06:02.987 --> 00:06:08.284
I'm asking you the obvious

00:06:08.492 --> 00:06:11.704
| want to feel the warmth

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:17.751
of asking the hard questions

00:06:20.337 --> 00:06:23.799
How do I keep moving forward

00:06:24.174 --> 00:06:29.597
over ice that is easily shattered?

00:06:29.805 --> 00:06:40.232
There you were,
staring at the loose threads of my love

00:06:40.441 --> 00:06:45.571
and the scars that I had hidden

00:06:45.779 --> 00:06:54.079
But please, don't take my pain away from me

00:07:18.979 --> 00:07:21.023
I, Milly Ashford, am currently
in the kingdom of Zilkhstan,

00:07:21.231 --> 00:07:24.777
which is well known for
being a nation of warriors.

00:07:24.985 --> 00:07:26.862
It has been an impregnable kingdom,

00:07:27.071 --> 00:07:29.782
which has repelled all invasions
by larger powers ever since its founding.

00:07:31.742 --> 00:07:34.453
The soldiers of Zilkhstan
are well favored for their skills,

00:07:34.662 --> 00:07:37.581
and have served as
mercenaries all over the world.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.209
Ninety percent of the nation's
territory is barren land,

00:07:40.417 --> 00:07:43.128
and with few resources,
it is no exaggeration to say

00:07:43.337 --> 00:07:47.341
that the nation's major export
is soldiers--their military might.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:56.767
The captain of the Zilkhstani
royal guard has just returned.

00:07:56.976 --> 00:07:58.435
| will ask him for a word.

00:07:58.644 --> 00:07:59.895
Is this a good idea?

00:08:00.104 --> 00:08:01.271
It does call for a public statement.

00:08:01.271 --> 00:08:02.815
Regarding the so-called "Puzzlement in Hashvess"
that occurred It does call for a public statement.

00:08:02.815 --> 00:08:03.816
Regarding the so-called
"Puzzlement in Hashvess" that occurred

00:08:04.024 --> 00:08:06.360
at the Hashvess refugee camp earlier,

00:08:06.568 --> 00:08:09.321
can you comment on the missing
World Humanitarian Agency workers,

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:12.199
including Honorary Consultant Nunnally?

00:08:12.408 --> 00:08:15.327
Unfortunately, I have no new information.

00:08:15.536 --> 00:08:20.916
There are five countries, including Zilkhstan,
which have disputed borders in that area,

00:08:21.125 --> 00:08:25.504
so the search is not making much headway,
much to our dismay, as well.

00:08:25.504 --> 00:08:28.257
The loss of Miss Nunnally, who has
made such a tremendous contribution

00:08:28.465 --> 00:08:30.175
to the postwar international peace

00:08:30.384 --> 00:08:34.263
is a loss for all mankind
as we look to the future.

00:08:34.471 --> 00:08:38.475
It greatly pains our divine, as well.

00:08:40.853 --> 00:08:45.190
There, all done. Would you
spread out the sofreh, Lelouch?

00:08:47.484 --> 00:08:49.695
You did it before, remember?

00:09:02.291 --> 00:09:05.836
Okay, Lelouch. I'm sure you're hungry, right?

00:09:06.837 --> 00:09:09.339
You can eat whatever you like.

00:09:21.393 --> 00:09:22.811
Hold on! Calm down!

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.980
It's all right!

00:09:38.535 --> 00:09:45.459
Take it easy. There's nothing here to
be afraid of. Nothing that can hurt you.

00:09:45.667 --> 00:09:50.798
| know. I'll make you some warm milk.
With lots of honey in it.

00:10:44.226 --> 00:10:46.937
If it's not here, either...

00:11:07.749 --> 00:11:10.878
It doesn't look as though
they've found Lelouch, but still...

00:11:16.049 --> 00:11:19.553
The targets have noticed us.
They're dirty, all right.

00:11:34.318 --> 00:11:37.070
I'm begging you, don't drag us into this.

00:11:44.161 --> 00:11:46.121
Huh?! Aren't you...?

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:50.250
Kallen? You're as rough as ever,
in more ways than one.

00:11:50.459 --> 00:11:53.212
C.C., what are you doing here?

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:57.966
| could ask you the same thing.
What are you doing here, of all places?

00:11:58.175 --> 00:12:00.219
It has been too long, Miss C.C.

00:12:00.427 --> 00:12:03.222
Well, you see, we're here
because Prince Schneizel asked us

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:06.850
to go find the abducted Nunnally and Zero.

00:12:07.059 --> 00:12:09.978
He said this country seemed
to be the most likely.

00:12:10.187 --> 00:12:12.105
If he came out and accused them directly,

00:12:12.314 --> 00:12:16.693
there'd be a diplomatic dispute
over not having any proof. But now...

00:12:16.902 --> 00:12:21.782
Yes. Since they tried to eliminate us,
something appears to be up.

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:24.826
Miss C.C., have you seen the news?

00:12:25.035 --> 00:12:27.913
Oh, no, I'm here--

00:12:30.374 --> 00:12:32.251
If you're a tourist,

00:12:32.459 --> 00:12:35.045
you're out of luck.

00:12:53.772 --> 00:12:55.857
You men stand down.

00:12:56.066 --> 00:12:58.652
Huh? Are you in charge here?

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:01.530
Isn't this attraction a
bit too hard on the tourists?

00:13:01.738 --> 00:13:05.742
| thought it was just right for you
United Federation of Nations dogs.

00:13:05.951 --> 00:13:09.413
Heh, then why don't we settle
this question one-on-one?

00:13:09.621 --> 00:13:14.459
No. I'm no knight or samurai, you see.

00:13:24.177 --> 00:13:26.054
Huh? What is this?

00:13:26.263 --> 00:13:28.515
Miss Kallen? What is it?

00:13:30.017 --> 00:13:31.768
When did you get there?!

00:13:31.977 --> 00:13:32.894
You can't escape!

00:13:33.103 --> 00:13:35.105
Miss Kallen! What has come over you?!

00:13:35.314 --> 00:13:39.735
Having our adversaries destroy
each other is fitting.

00:13:46.199 --> 00:13:48.702
How many brothers do you have?!

00:13:50.787 --> 00:13:51.913
Don't tell me...

00:13:52.122 --> 00:13:53.623
Let me go, you...!

00:13:53.832 --> 00:13:55.250
| knew it. Geass.

00:13:55.459 --> 00:14:01.631
Ho, you know about Geass?
I'll have to check into your backgrounds.

00:14:04.384 --> 00:14:06.762
You! But you should...

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:09.598
...be dead, is that it?

00:14:11.391 --> 00:14:12.309
Huh?

00:14:12.517 --> 00:14:16.480
So that's it. A Geass that allows you
to switch recognition of an individual.

00:14:16.688 --> 00:14:18.482
Quite a modest little power, isn't it?

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:23.278
Oh, it's plenty useful on the battlefield.

00:14:29.409 --> 00:14:33.955
Hey, give me a hand, you two.
| want to capture this Geass user.

00:14:34.164 --> 00:14:35.248
Very well.

00:14:35.457 --> 00:14:39.169
What? My Geass didn't work?
It couldn't be...!

00:14:39.378 --> 00:14:41.088
You picked on the wrong girl.

00:14:41.296 --> 00:14:45.425
| see. Forgive us for having treated you,
a former master, as we did.

00:14:45.634 --> 00:14:47.928
We'll be back later.

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:52.099
They're from one of the splinter factions.

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.480
C.C., were they from your--

00:14:58.688 --> 00:15:00.899
| am no longer with the Order.

00:15:01.108 --> 00:15:03.610
V.V. is gone now,
and it's unclear who has the authority--

00:15:03.819 --> 00:15:05.362
We can talk later.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:08.907
Miss C.C., I apologize for
bringing you into this, but right now--

00:15:09.116 --> 00:15:11.785
| get it. But...

00:15:11.993 --> 00:15:12.619
What?

00:15:12.828 --> 00:15:13.995
There's someone with me.

00:15:14.204 --> 00:15:16.873
Then I hate to say this,
but they have to leave with us.

00:15:17.082 --> 00:15:19.084
Yeah, you're right.

00:15:19.292 --> 00:15:22.212
If the police were to find him,
it would pose a problem.

00:15:32.597 --> 00:15:35.016
You there, please come with us.

00:15:39.813 --> 00:15:42.482
Um, we need to get going.

00:15:42.691 --> 00:15:44.025
Master Lelouch?

00:15:44.234 --> 00:15:45.652
Huh?

00:15:54.619 --> 00:15:57.414
It's all right, Lelouch! It's all right!

00:15:57.622 --> 00:15:59.624
Huh? Is it really...?

00:15:59.833 --> 00:16:06.465
Well, you see... this is Lelouch...
and yet not Lelouch.

00:16:20.896 --> 00:16:26.026
This is the service center. The source
of the problem was as we expected.

00:16:26.234 --> 00:16:29.404
We'd like to salvage two parts for it,
so we need to request your assistance.

00:16:29.613 --> 00:16:33.408
Also, we've managed
to acquire a new customer,

00:16:33.617 --> 00:16:37.537
and we may need the
requiem sheet music. If you please.

00:16:38.622 --> 00:16:43.335
It's possible that Lelouch
once inherited a Code from Charles.

00:16:43.543 --> 00:16:45.212
The one that gives him immortality?

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:50.050
Yes. But Lelouch used
his Geass afterward, as well.

00:16:50.258 --> 00:16:53.136
What happened when he performed it
without the Code issue being resolved

00:16:53.345 --> 00:16:54.346
was the Zero Requiem.

00:16:54.554 --> 00:16:57.098
And Shirley got involved after that?

00:16:57.307 --> 00:17:01.686
Yeah. She is a private citizen,
unwatched by any side.

00:17:01.895 --> 00:17:04.648
| had her bring his body
to the place Jeremiah lined up

00:17:04.856 --> 00:17:07.067
without drawing any attention.

00:17:07.275 --> 00:17:12.072
After that, I tried to
reconstruct Lelouch in Cs' World.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:13.782
Reconstruct?

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:17.911
The reason I can't die is because
| replace any defective body parts

00:17:18.119 --> 00:17:19.871
with those constructed in Cs' World.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.623
Like a mirror backup, huh?

00:17:21.831 --> 00:17:26.211
Not exactly, but in a general sense,
you can think of it that way.

00:17:26.419 --> 00:17:30.715
The problem is, Lelouch killed God in Cs' World.

00:17:30.924 --> 00:17:34.803
Because of that, I can no
longer freely enter Cs' World.

00:17:35.011 --> 00:17:37.180
But you just came back
to life earlier, didn't you?

00:17:37.389 --> 00:17:40.308
Yeah. There are probably
some parts still left over.

00:17:40.517 --> 00:17:43.436
In any case, Lelouch's mind has gone missing.

00:17:43.645 --> 00:17:45.647
Then, who is this person?

00:17:45.855 --> 00:17:50.277
The empty vessel of Lelouch's body.
The sorrowful ruin of what he once was.

00:17:50.485 --> 00:17:52.195
C.C.!

00:17:52.404 --> 00:17:55.532
Is this what Lelouch wanted?!

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:58.702
I still have a promise in place with him.

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:02.038
And so you just went ahead and...?!

00:18:03.164 --> 00:18:04.791
| know.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:10.714
And I won't leave him like this forever.
That's the reason why I came here.

00:18:10.922 --> 00:18:14.843
You saw those assassins last night, right?
They used Geass.

00:18:15.051 --> 00:18:20.473
There's an organization here in Zilkhstan,
separate from the Geass Order, called Farlaf.

00:18:20.682 --> 00:18:22.851
If I use the Aramu Gate,

00:18:23.059 --> 00:18:27.772
an access system into Cs' World,
which they control, then there's a chance.

00:18:39.743 --> 00:18:40.869
I'm terribly sorry,

00:18:41.077 --> 00:18:43.913
but those United Federation
of Nations dogs gave us the slip.

00:18:44.122 --> 00:18:47.751
| realize someone got in the way,
but this isn't like you, Qujappat.

00:18:47.959 --> 00:18:50.128
She is who she is, after all.

00:18:50.337 --> 00:18:51.755
A former master?

00:18:51.963 --> 00:18:54.591
Yes. Master V.V.'s predecessor.

00:18:54.799 --> 00:18:56.551
C.C.?

00:18:58.261 --> 00:19:02.349
Is her arrival at this time a revelation,
or is it an offering?

00:19:02.557 --> 00:19:05.060
Regardless of whether the
intruders are Federation spies

00:19:05.268 --> 00:19:07.020
or are connected with Geass,

00:19:07.228 --> 00:19:09.939
there are only two conceivable
objectives the enemy may have.

00:19:10.148 --> 00:19:12.275
This temple, in which you sit, Princess...

00:19:12.484 --> 00:19:15.445
...and the Wailing Prison,
located on the Gimsula Plains.

00:19:15.654 --> 00:19:19.240
Mm-hmm. The hostages are there.

00:19:19.449 --> 00:19:22.327
If the United Federation of Nations
finds any evidence,

00:19:22.535 --> 00:19:24.788
the whole region is at risk of an air strike.

00:19:24.996 --> 00:19:29.668
That's it. The old Aramu Gate
is inside the Wailing Prison.

00:19:29.876 --> 00:19:31.920
Where's my brother? Where is Shalio?

00:19:32.128 --> 00:19:36.007
Still at the prison.
Probably with him, as usual.

00:19:36.216 --> 00:19:40.929
Tell him to return at once. You go to
the prison, Shesthaal, to take his place.

00:19:41.137 --> 00:19:46.184
Namjala latak. 1, Shesthaal,
son of the great Forgnar,

00:19:46.393 --> 00:19:50.188
will show the United Federation
of Nations my fighting genes.

00:20:25.807 --> 00:20:31.646
Tell me, can you see, Zero?
Or rather, Suzaku Kururugi?

00:20:31.855 --> 00:20:35.275
These are the moves you showed off
time and again in Asia and the E.U.

00:20:38.153 --> 00:20:40.071
What was your attitude control at these times?

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:42.407
These moves aren't in
the programming, are they?

00:20:42.615 --> 00:20:44.868
And why is it that when
you were using the Albion,

00:20:45.076 --> 00:20:49.330
your movement changed midway through?
It wasn't the design, was it?

00:20:49.539 --> 00:20:53.793
What about you? How did you
know what moves I would make?

00:20:54.002 --> 00:20:58.298
How did you set a trap in the place
| would back into? Was it Geass?

00:20:58.506 --> 00:21:03.052
That again? I wish you would
finish answering my questions.

00:21:03.261 --> 00:21:05.972
Don't forget that we have Nunnally.

00:21:06.181 --> 00:21:09.100
You're more despicable than I thought.

00:21:09.309 --> 00:21:16.649
Yeah, I am. I will do anything it takes
to be the world's greatest warrior.

00:21:16.858 --> 00:21:21.237
| need pure strength to protect
the ones who are dear to me.

00:21:21.446 --> 00:21:26.910
Unadulterated guile,
and sheer perfidy, such as your own.

00:21:27.118 --> 00:21:30.914
You wouldn't choose death
except to protect someone.

00:21:31.122 --> 00:21:36.127
That's all the data we've
figured out so far. Now, tell me!

00:21:36.336 --> 00:21:39.088
Do it to protect Nunnally!

00:21:41.257 --> 00:21:44.677
Suzaku Kururugi, all of
your strength shall be mine.

00:21:44.886 --> 00:21:46.137
Your Majesty...

00:21:48.306 --> 00:21:49.098
Big sister?

00:21:49.307 --> 00:21:50.183
Yes.

00:21:50.391 --> 00:21:52.143
Oh well, then.

00:21:54.687 --> 00:21:58.441
Once you have all the data saved,
return to the castle.

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:00.276
Namjala latak.

00:22:07.325 --> 00:22:07.909
Is something wrong?

00:22:08.117 --> 00:22:10.203
Oh, there are more of those lately.

00:22:10.411 --> 00:22:13.748
Yes, the energy packs
have been falling short.

00:22:13.957 --> 00:22:17.043
General Forgnar is reaching out to Indonesia,

00:22:17.252 --> 00:22:20.004
but everyone is too busy
rebuilding their own lands.

00:22:20.213 --> 00:22:25.468
It all comes down to national strength.
We have to make sure this succeeds.

00:22:25.677 --> 00:22:28.012
Including big sister's current plan.

00:22:29.514 --> 00:22:30.181
Are they gone?

00:22:30.390 --> 00:22:32.851
Yeah. Even if they get
suspicious and come back,

00:22:33.059 --> 00:22:35.770
we'll be inside the prison by then.

00:22:37.188 --> 00:22:40.733
Thanks for coming along
to carry all this stuff.

00:22:40.942 --> 00:22:43.695
You're not going to tell us you
didn't have a plan, are you?

00:22:43.903 --> 00:22:49.158
Well, sure. I was fixing up something
that didn't involve wearing these outfits.

00:22:51.411 --> 00:22:54.455
Does this Aramu Gate really exist out here?

00:22:54.664 --> 00:22:56.249
It used to be a temple.

00:22:56.457 --> 00:22:58.501
Looks like it's a prison now, though.

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:00.628
For bandits and
ideological offenders and such.

00:23:00.837 --> 00:23:04.674
Dr. Lloyd, we're about to go inside.

00:23:04.883 --> 00:23:07.468
If we can access this
Cs' World place from in here,

00:23:07.677 --> 00:23:09.012
Lelouch will come back to us, right?

00:23:09.220 --> 00:23:11.347
I'm just saying there's a possibility.

00:23:11.556 --> 00:23:12.348
Aw, man...

00:23:12.557 --> 00:23:15.310
| can't help but consider
what happens if it doesn't work.

00:23:16.352 --> 00:23:20.315
We still have a glimmer of hope.
That's enough for now.

00:23:34.037 --> 00:23:38.082
Ideological criminals and terrorists.
Hmm? The lower block?

00:23:38.291 --> 00:23:39.792
Keep this to yourself, please.

00:23:40.001 --> 00:23:44.797
They caused the Order a lot of trouble
and will be executed within a week.

00:23:45.006 --> 00:23:45.965
What's with him?

00:23:46.174 --> 00:23:49.218
Don't worry about him.
Apparently, he's done too many drugs.

00:24:05.485 --> 00:24:07.278
Hey, fresh meat!

00:24:07.487 --> 00:24:09.572
What are you guys in for?

00:24:09.781 --> 00:24:11.240
Women! Women!

00:24:11.449 --> 00:24:12.909
Hey, let's have some fun!

00:24:13.117 --> 00:24:15.078
Is that a guy in the middle?!

00:24:15.286 --> 00:24:17.997
Let's party! Let's party!

00:24:22.794 --> 00:24:23.836
Dr. Lloyd,

00:24:24.045 --> 00:24:27.674
we made it below. I'd like to make
our move before the strip search.

00:24:27.882 --> 00:24:29.842
How are the cameras coming?

00:24:30.802 --> 00:24:32.887
How unfortunate, it's just fine.

00:24:33.096 --> 00:24:35.390
I've already replaced it with a fake image.

00:24:35.598 --> 00:24:36.849
It's okay, everyone.

00:24:37.058 --> 00:24:37.600
Hmm?

00:24:37.809 --> 00:24:39.435
What's okay?

00:24:42.271 --> 00:24:43.690
Why, you!

00:24:44.774 --> 00:24:46.734
Thank you for showing us in.

00:24:49.404 --> 00:24:51.614
--Hey, now...
--Now they've done it.

00:24:51.823 --> 00:24:53.199
Heh, idiots.

00:24:53.408 --> 00:24:55.451
Hey, you can't get out of here.

00:24:55.660 --> 00:24:56.744
It's impossible.

00:24:56.953 --> 00:24:59.998
Guards, you seeing this?

00:25:05.253 --> 00:25:07.797
Hey, this is a card-key to this place.

00:25:08.006 --> 00:25:10.883
It's yours. I'll leave it up
to you what to do with it.

00:25:11.092 --> 00:25:12.927
You want us to break out, eh?

00:25:13.136 --> 00:25:14.679
Yahoo!

00:25:16.389 --> 00:25:17.765
This should be good!

00:25:17.974 --> 00:25:19.892
Yes! Let's do it!

00:25:20.101 --> 00:25:23.604
--I'm gonna kill those bastard guards!
--I hope this buys us a little time.

00:25:23.813 --> 00:25:26.858
Miss C.C., is the Aramu Gate on this floor?

00:25:27.066 --> 00:25:29.569
No, it's down farther than this.

00:25:29.777 --> 00:25:32.530
It used an underground waterway,
so it would be the lowest level.

00:25:32.739 --> 00:25:37.201
There would be no reason to destroy it,
so I think the passage is still there.

00:25:49.422 --> 00:25:51.466
That's unfortunate.

00:26:28.461 --> 00:26:31.130
Huh? A dead end?

00:26:32.590 --> 00:26:35.343
Could that thing be the gate?

00:26:35.551 --> 00:26:38.012
It's completely submerged
by the groundwater, though.

00:26:38.221 --> 00:26:40.556
Which is precisely why our chances are good--

00:26:40.765 --> 00:26:44.477
Our chances that the system
is still unused and intact.

00:26:58.533 --> 00:27:02.620
I'm grateful to whoever
it was that built this system.

00:27:02.829 --> 00:27:07.041
Wow. Where is all this water going?

00:27:08.251 --> 00:27:11.003
It's okay. Nothing to be afraid of.

00:27:12.922 --> 00:27:18.261
What gives? Don't stare at
me like that. It's as though...

00:27:30.439 --> 00:27:31.524
Well?

00:27:31.732 --> 00:27:33.776
The water volume from
the prison has increased,

00:27:33.985 --> 00:27:36.737
so the Ministry of Interior
wants us to check the floodgates.

00:27:36.946 --> 00:27:40.408
Hmph, they could have just told Bitool directly.

00:27:40.616 --> 00:27:42.034
There seems to have been an emergency,

00:27:42.243 --> 00:27:44.162
and communication protocols are in effect.

00:27:44.370 --> 00:27:45.663
| know!

00:27:45.872 --> 00:27:51.502
Hmph, they appreciate groundwater
more than they do Knightmare Frames.

00:28:01.846 --> 00:28:03.764
C.C., can you take Lelouch?

00:28:03.973 --> 00:28:06.267
Yeah. You keep watch over this place.

00:28:06.475 --> 00:28:07.560
Leave it to us.

00:28:07.768 --> 00:28:08.686
Miss Kallen?

00:28:08.895 --> 00:28:10.062
What is it, Sayoko?

00:28:10.271 --> 00:28:14.942
I'd like to go check on the riot and
secure what we'll need for our escape.

00:28:15.151 --> 00:28:16.360
Please do.

00:28:16.569 --> 00:28:18.070
| will return shortly.

00:28:19.864 --> 00:28:22.825
Come back to us, Lelouch.

00:28:41.010 --> 00:28:46.140
Relax. We're going to put an end
to you being this way this time for sure.

00:29:28.891 --> 00:29:31.143
It looks like we made it in.

00:29:33.145 --> 00:29:37.692
What's going on here? Why are people's
consciousnesses just staying put?

00:29:50.454 --> 00:29:52.832
Is something the matter, Princess Shamna?

00:29:53.040 --> 00:29:56.836
No change. Is that attachment
or perhaps absent longing?

00:29:57.044 --> 00:29:58.504
Longing?

00:29:59.380 --> 00:30:01.090
| beg your pardon!

00:30:22.028 --> 00:30:23.988
So that's why, Charles.

00:30:24.196 --> 00:30:27.491
The remnants of your desires
and the wishes you left behind

00:30:27.700 --> 00:30:29.952
have created a barrier here.

00:30:30.161 --> 00:30:33.706
So we're going to need Nunnally after all.

00:30:35.583 --> 00:30:39.211
Damn it, men, can't you be
a little more civilized about this?!

00:30:39.420 --> 00:30:40.963
How many intruders are there?

00:30:41.172 --> 00:30:42.757
The thing of it is, Warden,

00:30:42.965 --> 00:30:46.344
it looks like it's just the people
we were playing prisoner for.

00:30:46.552 --> 00:30:50.264
Huh? That's not nearly enough of them.
Are they plotting something?

00:30:50.473 --> 00:30:53.142
All we know is that they went
to the underground floodgate.

00:30:53.351 --> 00:30:55.644
Is there anything down there?

00:30:55.853 --> 00:30:58.230
Just the temple from before we relocated here.

00:30:58.439 --> 00:31:00.775
They're planning on
searching each floor by turns.

00:31:00.983 --> 00:31:05.321
All right, we'll stamp them out on
the bottom floor. Less damage that way.

00:31:05.529 --> 00:31:08.949
Relay this to the big elite on the outside.

00:31:09.158 --> 00:31:13.329
You mean the honorable and proud
royal guard Captain Shesthaal?

00:31:13.537 --> 00:31:16.582
You idiot, don't echo what I say.

00:31:17.708 --> 00:31:18.459
Stand by?

00:31:18.667 --> 00:31:22.380
Yes, sir. Warden Bitool said that due
to the complex construction of the prison,

00:31:22.588 --> 00:31:24.632
they would deal with it themselves.

00:31:24.840 --> 00:31:26.842
That glorified bandit...!

00:31:27.051 --> 00:31:29.637
Does he think this is his own little kingdom?

00:31:39.188 --> 00:31:42.400
Sayoko, you shouldn't bring
a Knightmare down here.

00:31:42.608 --> 00:31:48.489
Oh, actually, we found something
that's bound to shake things up a bit.

00:31:48.697 --> 00:31:52.034
But the prisoners are free to do
whatever they want, and...

00:31:52.243 --> 00:31:52.868
Oh...

00:31:53.077 --> 00:31:57.456
Yes. They were all on staff here.
They were one step ahead of us.

00:31:57.665 --> 00:31:59.583
Got it. I'll buy us some time.

00:31:59.792 --> 00:32:01.085
Dr. Lloyd, you've got C.C. and Lelouch.

00:32:01.293 --> 00:32:04.088
Huh? I don't know what you expect me to do.

00:32:05.589 --> 00:32:10.386
Well, I suppose this is some
rather fascinating research material.

00:32:12.596 --> 00:32:14.515
Heh-heh, this makes our day.

00:32:14.723 --> 00:32:17.852
Yeah. Lucky for us,
the upstairs security didn't get them.

00:32:18.060 --> 00:32:21.021
You guys weren't here for
that hunt last week, were you?

00:32:21.230 --> 00:32:25.109
Thank you so much.
| love me some redheaded women!

00:32:26.485 --> 00:32:31.073
Opening fire without saying anything first?
| like your style.

00:32:35.411 --> 00:32:36.370
A Ghedo Vakka!

00:32:36.579 --> 00:32:37.538
That's not good!

00:32:37.746 --> 00:32:40.916
Coming from the lower floor, huh? Nice!

00:32:45.504 --> 00:32:48.507
| hate to do this, but I have to take you out.

00:32:54.638 --> 00:32:58.142
Control Room, there's risk of a collapse!
We need a rescue team!

00:32:58.350 --> 00:33:00.478
Would you guys knock it off?!

00:33:00.686 --> 00:33:02.480
Hey, do you read me, Control Room?

00:33:02.688 --> 00:33:05.483
No, are they jamming us?

00:33:12.323 --> 00:33:15.826
Man! This thing has lousy visibility!

00:33:18.871 --> 00:33:22.541
My compliments. Not bad for
being in an unfamiliar machine.

00:33:32.218 --> 00:33:35.804
Why, Charles? Have you become
a wedge between worlds,

00:33:36.013 --> 00:33:39.975
as a result of Lelouch killing God?
Or is it something else?

00:33:47.149 --> 00:33:48.567
Lelouch!

00:33:50.027 --> 00:33:52.530
No! Over here!

00:33:56.242 --> 00:33:58.202
If we shoot any more down here...!

00:33:58.410 --> 00:34:01.747
You're right; we'll probably get buried alive!

00:34:03.290 --> 00:34:04.041
--Miss Kallen!
--Over there! Over there!

00:34:04.250 --> 00:34:06.293
Don't mess with me, punk!

00:34:12.508 --> 00:34:17.638
Whoa there, that's enough. The next one
is a bomb that will blow us both up.

00:34:17.846 --> 00:34:20.599
Warden Bitool, we can't contact the outside.

00:34:20.808 --> 00:34:22.017
These guys might have cut us off.

00:34:22.226 --> 00:34:23.978
Go take a quick look below you.

00:34:24.186 --> 00:34:25.521
Huh? There's nothing there.

00:34:25.729 --> 00:34:27.940
That's what bothers me! Get going!

00:34:28.148 --> 00:34:29.024
All right.

00:34:29.233 --> 00:34:33.862
Now then, what kind of fun should
| have with you, Federation lady--

00:34:34.071 --> 00:34:37.241
Or no, maybe you're with the Black Knights?

00:34:41.787 --> 00:34:45.583
Lelouch! Where are you, Lelouch?!

00:34:46.333 --> 00:34:50.254
Are these souls with
nowhere to go, or Refrain?

00:34:50.713 --> 00:34:56.385
Charles, stop holding on! Let Lelouch go free!

00:35:03.017 --> 00:35:04.727
No change.

00:35:04.935 --> 00:35:09.773
Tell Shesthaal to respectfully
receive the master if she is there.

00:35:09.982 --> 00:35:13.527
She may be of assistance
with the new gateway.

00:35:13.736 --> 00:35:15.613
Namjala latak.

00:35:23.037 --> 00:35:26.498
No! If this keeps up, his remaining
consciousness will be swallowed up!

00:35:26.707 --> 00:35:29.209
Lelouch! We're getting out of here!

00:35:59.239 --> 00:36:03.535
You've finally woken up.
What were you doing down here?

00:36:03.744 --> 00:36:05.120
Who are you?

00:36:05.329 --> 00:36:09.375
You should do your homework
before coming into another man's castle.

00:36:11.418 --> 00:36:16.131
Ho, it is you, all right--the woman
our elite told us about.

00:36:16.340 --> 00:36:18.634
| hear you're immortal, right?

00:36:18.842 --> 00:36:21.387
You know who I am?

00:36:28.227 --> 00:36:34.024
A complete Southern Cross!
Should we burn her or dissolve her next?

00:36:34.233 --> 00:36:37.986
Hey, break the arms of
those other two right away.

00:36:39.071 --> 00:36:41.657
Ho, you've already started healing?

00:36:41.865 --> 00:36:45.285
Then why don't you tell me,
what were you doing down here?

00:36:45.494 --> 00:36:49.581
If you don't tell me, I'll destroy these ruins.

00:36:49.790 --> 00:36:52.084
This is a dead end, is it?

00:36:53.419 --> 00:36:56.839
No, it isn't. That is incorrect.

00:37:03.595 --> 00:37:09.768
This reminds me of Narita, C.C.
You got hurt trying to cover for me then, too.

00:37:09.977 --> 00:37:13.480
You may not be able to die,
but you shed your blood too readily.

00:37:13.689 --> 00:37:15.607
Where did this guy come from?

00:37:28.912 --> 00:37:33.917
No way! Are you that treacherous emperor?
No, you couldn't be...

00:37:34.918 --> 00:37:39.590
Ah! So that's it!
These guys were hiding you here!

00:37:39.798 --> 00:37:42.926
You're in exile? No, you wouldn't
be here, then, would you?

00:37:43.135 --> 00:37:46.889
Hey, I don't dislike liars like you.

00:37:47.097 --> 00:37:50.893
Well, I do dislike men like yourself,
of inferior character.

00:37:51.101 --> 00:37:56.064
Oh, are you really that stupid,
Last Emperor Lelouch--

00:37:56.273 --> 00:37:58.317
Provoking me while unarmed?

00:37:58.525 --> 00:38:01.612
Unarmed? Oh no, I do have a weapon.

00:38:01.820 --> 00:38:05.282
A weapon that those
directly under me know all about.

00:38:06.700 --> 00:38:09.495
Lelouch vi Britannia commands you

00:38:09.703 --> 00:38:13.040
to die, right here, right now.

00:38:13.248 --> 00:38:18.253
No, if you don't want to die,
you'll say you're sorry--

00:38:22.132 --> 00:38:23.675
Namjala latak.

00:38:24.718 --> 00:38:26.595
--Namjala latak.
--Namjala latak.

00:38:33.101 --> 00:38:36.730
Hey, has something
happened down there? Hey!

00:38:45.197 --> 00:38:49.910
There's a lot more I have to say to you,
but I'm back, C.C.

00:38:50.118 --> 00:38:53.705
Yeah. Welcome home, Lelouch.

00:38:55.582 --> 00:38:58.335
He's relegating his command? Bitool?

00:38:58.544 --> 00:39:01.046
Yes, sir. He is just
the chief bandit, after all.

00:39:01.255 --> 00:39:02.172
Exactly.

00:39:02.381 --> 00:39:02.965
Huh?

00:39:03.173 --> 00:39:07.010
He senses the danger, and now
he's going to distance himself from it.

00:39:07.219 --> 00:39:11.473
Ugh, we don't know what the
intruders are after. Something's up.

00:39:11.682 --> 00:39:15.477
Plus, I can't use my Batalalan Du in here.

00:39:15.686 --> 00:39:18.397
It's better than messing up
and getting disposed of.

00:39:18.605 --> 00:39:20.232
What do we do with the woman?

00:39:20.440 --> 00:39:23.819
I'd like to say you can have her
after I've had my fun with her,

00:39:24.027 --> 00:39:25.737
but she looks good enough to be a gift

00:39:25.946 --> 00:39:30.325
to the king or the princess in the temple.
Take her to the infirmary.

00:39:32.369 --> 00:39:33.537
Master Lelouch?

00:39:33.745 --> 00:39:34.454
What is it?

00:39:34.663 --> 00:39:37.124
Miss Kallen is being taken to the infirmary.

00:39:37.332 --> 00:39:40.419
Probably the facility
on the fourth level. Also...

00:39:40.627 --> 00:39:41.253
What?

00:39:41.461 --> 00:39:44.381
Command of the investigation is
being turned over to the royal guard.

00:39:44.590 --> 00:39:45.716
Royal guard?

00:39:45.924 --> 00:39:48.719
Yes. They appear to be standing by outside.

00:39:48.927 --> 00:39:51.722
All right. Then we're
switching the mission to Zebra.

00:39:51.930 --> 00:39:53.682
Understood.

00:39:53.891 --> 00:39:56.184
Is there some internal conflict in this country?

00:39:56.393 --> 00:39:58.270
This is a move that suggests
a territorial dispute.

00:39:58.478 --> 00:40:00.397
That's because it's ruled
by a brother and sister.

00:40:00.606 --> 00:40:02.858
The sister presides over the religious,
the brother over the military.

00:40:03.066 --> 00:40:04.818
| don't know more than that, though.

00:40:05.027 --> 00:40:06.194
For the love of...

00:40:06.403 --> 00:40:09.740
Coming up with an escape plan
before breaking in is fundamental--

00:40:10.657 --> 00:40:13.785
Excellency, I've taken over the system here.

00:40:13.994 --> 00:40:15.787
You have? Good work.

00:40:15.996 --> 00:40:18.498
Now, as for this floor,
do you know what it's used for?

00:40:18.707 --> 00:40:23.921
Excellency, you noticed it, too?
There's only one person left there.

00:40:24.129 --> 00:40:27.507
Under the circumstances,
are they going to need to move him out,

00:40:27.716 --> 00:40:31.511
or is he too important, and they
can't risk moving him carelessly?

00:40:54.201 --> 00:41:00.499
Sorry, I didn't mean to wake you,
Zero--I mean, Suzaku Kururugi.

00:41:03.835 --> 00:41:07.089
| had the doctor check you out,
but you shouldn't be moving around yet.

00:41:07.297 --> 00:41:10.968
As long as you're here, the enemy
has to watch what moves it makes.

00:41:12.719 --> 00:41:17.599
In any case, this helps me.
I'll need your help to clear all conditions.

00:41:17.808 --> 00:41:19.017
Lelouch...?

00:41:19.226 --> 00:41:19.810
Yeah.

00:41:20.018 --> 00:41:22.521
Is it really you?

00:41:22.729 --> 00:41:24.982
Go ahead and check me.

00:41:30.779 --> 00:41:32.739
You're alive?

00:41:32.948 --> 00:41:35.075
So it seems.

00:41:35.283 --> 00:41:36.368
It seems?

00:41:36.576 --> 00:41:39.955
It seems?! You make it sound
like you're not involved!

00:41:40.163 --> 00:41:42.207
Yeah, I suppose I do.

00:41:42.416 --> 00:41:47.087
Did you... Did you lie to me again?!

00:41:47.295 --> 00:41:48.922
I'm not going to excuse myself.

00:41:49.965 --> 00:41:51.591
Do what you must.

00:41:51.800 --> 00:41:57.014
Do you know... what I...
what everyone... had to go through?!

00:41:57.222 --> 00:42:00.642
Why did you keep it
to yourself, you coward?!

00:42:00.851 --> 00:42:03.186
Why?! Why?!

00:42:03.395 --> 00:42:06.732
Stop, Suzaku! Suzaku!

00:42:09.526 --> 00:42:13.905
Lelouch wanted to stay dead, but I insisted!

00:42:15.407 --> 00:42:17.743
C.C...?

00:42:20.370 --> 00:42:25.083
I'm impressed that you were even
able to move in your condition.

00:42:27.461 --> 00:42:29.755
Attention, intruders inside the facility.

00:42:29.963 --> 00:42:33.216
| am the captain of Shamna,
the Divine's royal guard,

00:42:33.425 --> 00:42:35.635
Shesthaal Forgnar.

00:42:35.844 --> 00:42:40.057
This prison facility is completely surrounded.

00:42:40.265 --> 00:42:45.187
Surrender. I repeat, surrender at once.

00:42:45.395 --> 00:42:48.356
Evacuation of all prison personnel
is nearly complete.

00:42:48.565 --> 00:42:50.817
If you do not contact us before they finish,

00:42:51.026 --> 00:42:54.362
then I can no longer guarantee your survival.

00:42:54.571 --> 00:42:58.408
Also, if the one who was previously
within the Order comes forward,

00:42:58.617 --> 00:43:01.453
she will be treated as a guest of the state.

00:43:01.661 --> 00:43:05.290
Guest of the state?
What do they want from you?

00:43:05.499 --> 00:43:09.753
Beats me. We parted ways over 300 years ago.

00:43:09.961 --> 00:43:11.588
Who knows what happened to their founders.

00:43:11.797 --> 00:43:16.593
Excellency, I built it around the
Knightmare Frame simulator.

00:43:16.802 --> 00:43:17.427
Communications?

00:43:17.636 --> 00:43:19.387
See for yourself.

00:43:20.722 --> 00:43:22.057
From the perpetrators?

00:43:22.265 --> 00:43:24.518
Yes, sir. What would you like to do?

00:43:24.726 --> 00:43:26.812
Doesn't matter. Put them through.

00:43:28.188 --> 00:43:34.319
Calling the brazen Shesthaal Forgnar.
Calling the brazen Shesthaal Forgnar.

00:43:34.528 --> 00:43:38.865
We are simply tourists.
Remove your ridiculous cordon,

00:43:39.074 --> 00:43:40.951
and leave the area immediately.

00:43:42.119 --> 00:43:44.287
| don't mind about myself,

00:43:44.496 --> 00:43:47.457
but I insist that you take back
your insult toward the Forgnar family.

00:43:47.666 --> 00:43:53.755
Ho, who knew that mercenaries could
gain such honor over a scant 120 years?

00:43:53.964 --> 00:44:00.303
Why, do accept my apologies.
Even thieves and bandits have their pride.

00:44:00.512 --> 00:44:02.472
If you have any smarts, leave now.

00:44:02.681 --> 00:44:05.767
If you are a fool, head right on in.

00:44:07.394 --> 00:44:09.729
All personnel, prepare for battle.

00:44:09.938 --> 00:44:12.023
We'll neutralize them
from ground level on down.

00:44:12.232 --> 00:44:15.569
They're going to attack? The fools. Suzaku?

00:44:15.777 --> 00:44:19.447
| know, Lelouch.
You really have come back, huh?

00:44:19.656 --> 00:44:20.866
Wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:44:21.074 --> 00:44:24.369
You can't pilot that ugly
Knightmare in your condition!

00:44:24.578 --> 00:44:25.704
I'm all right.

00:44:25.912 --> 00:44:27.914
I'm Zero, after all.

00:44:28.123 --> 00:44:30.834
I'm the one who has pledged to sacrifice
myself for the sake of the world.

00:44:31.042 --> 00:44:35.130
That may be one of your strengths,
but it's also a drawback.

00:44:35.338 --> 00:44:42.554
| know. But I don't know of any
other way to undo this failure. So...

00:44:46.266 --> 00:44:51.521
My apologies. I'm going
to need your assistance after all.

00:44:51.730 --> 00:44:54.024
Lelouch vi Britannia commands you!

00:45:03.700 --> 00:45:04.743
Thanks, Sayoko.

00:45:04.951 --> 00:45:06.745
I'm just glad I was in time.

00:45:06.953 --> 00:45:09.956
We have to go and guard Dr. Lloyd now.

00:45:24.095 --> 00:45:28.725
If she truly is a master, she should
be able to withstand this. So...

00:45:28.934 --> 00:45:34.231
All personnel, take control of all
floors quickly, in the name of Forgnar!

00:45:34.439 --> 00:45:35.857
Namjala latak.

00:45:38.068 --> 00:45:41.029
Lelouch, this strategy of yours
can beat them, can't it?

00:45:41.238 --> 00:45:43.448
If you do what I told you to do.

00:45:43.657 --> 00:45:45.867
| think I know your method
of operating pretty well.

00:45:46.076 --> 00:45:49.412
Hmph. Then follow your instructions.

00:45:56.836 --> 00:45:59.965
They closed off the entrance.
That was expected.

00:46:04.928 --> 00:46:08.098
P-9, continue backing away.
P-2 and B-4, rendezvous with R.

00:46:08.306 --> 00:46:08.974
Draw the enemy inside.

00:46:09.182 --> 00:46:11.851
All personnel, continue
taking control of each floor!

00:46:12.060 --> 00:46:13.561
Madin, maintain your position.

00:46:13.770 --> 00:46:16.523
Guard the bridge-laying tank
on its way here from Ablaq Base.

00:46:16.731 --> 00:46:18.650
K-1, move into action.

00:46:20.860 --> 00:46:24.614
A Ghedo Vakka? Pay it no mind.
It's a decoy to let their soldiers escape.

00:46:24.823 --> 00:46:27.367
That's right. You'll think it's an enemy decoy.

00:46:27.575 --> 00:46:29.995
Ridiculous. Is this all you've got?

00:46:30.203 --> 00:46:32.580
All right, keep running the enemy down!

00:46:32.789 --> 00:46:35.375
Q Team, you have two minutes
to get everything wrapped up.

00:46:35.583 --> 00:46:37.836
You're just an incompetent
buffoon who's all talk.

00:46:38.044 --> 00:46:40.005
K-1, lure them in.

00:46:41.548 --> 00:46:45.176
Captain, the captured Knightmare
fled down to the lower floor.

00:46:45.385 --> 00:46:49.097
Good! Press the attack!
The others are sure to be there, too.

00:46:49.306 --> 00:46:52.475
Everyone knows that bandits
can't beat a heroic bloodline!

00:46:52.684 --> 00:46:55.061
K-1, continue as planned.

00:47:03.069 --> 00:47:06.364
I've come for you, Zero.

00:47:06.573 --> 00:47:09.826
Zero? If you're thinking of escaping,

00:47:10.035 --> 00:47:13.455
then you must know what will
happen to the other hostage.

00:47:13.663 --> 00:47:18.501
Captain Shesthaal of the royal guard,
your pride is of no account.

00:47:18.710 --> 00:47:21.504
This is checkmate.

00:47:23.631 --> 00:47:27.677
No! Father!!

00:47:32.182 --> 00:47:34.559
My Sakuradite...!

00:47:42.942 --> 00:47:45.195
Kallen? Thank you, too--

00:47:45.987 --> 00:47:46.988
Master Lelouch...

00:47:47.197 --> 00:47:47.947
What is it?

00:47:48.156 --> 00:47:51.659
Are you sure we shouldn't deal
with the other staff members?

00:47:51.868 --> 00:47:54.662
Yeah. Turn them loose.

00:47:54.871 --> 00:47:58.666
The Geass I cast on them earlier
ended with their cooperation.

00:48:00.168 --> 00:48:02.003
Is there something different about you?

00:48:02.212 --> 00:48:04.798
Hmm? Good question.

00:48:05.006 --> 00:48:07.926
As for what's next, we're going to cross
the border at a village called Lodus--

00:48:08.134 --> 00:48:09.844
Yeah, never mind about that.

00:48:10.053 --> 00:48:10.637
Why?

00:48:10.845 --> 00:48:14.599
Lelouch can't very well
be publicly rescued, can he?

00:48:15.975 --> 00:48:17.102
Right.

00:48:17.310 --> 00:48:20.230
Besides, there's something else I have to do.

00:48:20.438 --> 00:48:24.442
Hit the enemy as hard and as
fast as I can, and rescue Nunnally.

00:48:34.119 --> 00:48:40.375
Princess, this is Forgnar.
| heard that King Shalio was here.

00:48:40.583 --> 00:48:42.252
Enter.

00:48:44.337 --> 00:48:51.010
King Shalio, is it true that
my son, Shesthaal, has died?

00:48:51.219 --> 00:48:55.306
Yeah. We just got word
from Bitool, the warden.

00:48:55.515 --> 00:48:59.227
Bitool, when did Shesthaal die?

00:48:59.436 --> 00:49:02.147
Midday. Around 11:00, I would say.

00:49:02.355 --> 00:49:05.275
We had no idea that
the enemy was so formidable.

00:49:05.483 --> 00:49:09.487
| see. That makes it more
than six hours, doesn't it?

00:49:09.696 --> 00:49:10.405
Big sister?

00:49:10.613 --> 00:49:11.781
My king,

00:49:11.990 --> 00:49:15.618
please give me your order.
Tell me to hunt down those Federation--

00:49:15.827 --> 00:49:20.457
Those Black Knight dogs, and avenge my son!

00:49:20.665 --> 00:49:21.666
Generalissimo...

00:49:21.875 --> 00:49:22.417
Yes?

00:49:22.625 --> 00:49:24.878
Your military might is undeniable.

00:49:25.086 --> 00:49:28.089
But the enemy may have
someone who possesses Geass.

00:49:28.298 --> 00:49:31.759
Princess, we are not even
certain that was a master.

00:49:31.968 --> 00:49:34.429
| know! I am just saying
to prepare for the worst.

00:49:34.637 --> 00:49:36.347
Yes, Highness. Forgive me.

00:49:36.556 --> 00:49:39.267
Big sister, if they do have a Geass...

00:49:39.476 --> 00:49:44.022
It's all right. Once I make my prophecy,
we can beat any enemy.

00:49:44.230 --> 00:49:45.565
Just as we captured Zero?

00:49:45.773 --> 00:49:50.403
Yes. But never mind that; we have
to hurry and complete things here.

00:49:51.446 --> 00:49:57.494
This is all because your brother
destroyed the laws of Cs' World.

00:49:57.702 --> 00:50:00.079
By using you, whose wavelength
is close to Charles,

00:50:00.288 --> 00:50:03.208
the one who failed to change things over,

00:50:03.416 --> 00:50:07.462
| will be able to transcend Cs' World.

00:50:09.422 --> 00:50:12.425
"United Federation of Nations Headquarters"

00:50:12.592 --> 00:50:16.846
Are you sure?
Zilkhstan has abducted Nunnally?

00:50:17.055 --> 00:50:20.308
According to the report
from Lloyd and Agent Shinozaki, yes.

00:50:20.517 --> 00:50:23.686
Hmph, I wish she'd have used me
instead of the Earl of Pudding.

00:50:23.895 --> 00:50:25.605
| know the area.

00:50:25.813 --> 00:50:30.109
| want you at my side,
as my technical advisor.

00:50:31.319 --> 00:50:33.029
Still, I don't get it.

00:50:33.238 --> 00:50:35.657
Why would a country that small
turn the world against them,

00:50:35.865 --> 00:50:37.700
when there's no way they can win?

00:50:37.909 --> 00:50:40.578
I'm not sure if it has
anything to do with that,

00:50:40.787 --> 00:50:42.747
but I received one other troubling report.

00:50:42.956 --> 00:50:45.792
Hmm? Something you can't even tell me?

00:50:46.000 --> 00:50:50.255
The thing is, it sounds like
Geass is involved, as well.

00:50:50.463 --> 00:50:53.007
Does this have to do with why
you called in Shanti and the others?

00:50:53.216 --> 00:50:54.050
Yes.

00:50:54.259 --> 00:50:56.761
They're the child prodigies
that you brought together,

00:50:56.970 --> 00:50:59.722
so I thought it best
that you tell them yourself.

00:50:59.931 --> 00:51:03.977
Sis, I sent that Frame Coat to Pudding.

00:51:04.185 --> 00:51:08.773
For the Lancelot? That unit could
be seen as a symbol of tyranny.

00:51:08.982 --> 00:51:13.695
Was that wrong? I thought it
would be necessary if Zero is safe.

00:51:13.903 --> 00:51:17.365
Of course it's wrong. Send in another set.

00:51:17.574 --> 00:51:20.618
Hmph, if you say so. Shanti?

00:51:20.827 --> 00:51:24.497
| thought she would say that,
so I already have it ready.

00:51:36.175 --> 00:51:39.637
| hope they don't find out.
We're just over the border, but still...

00:51:39.846 --> 00:51:44.392
Princess Cornelia's name is
dreaded in the area. Moreover...

00:51:44.601 --> 00:51:48.104
This region makes its
living by stealing and spying.

00:51:49.689 --> 00:51:55.486
And they can use Geass, too.
His Excellency sure is a cautious one.

00:51:55.695 --> 00:51:59.324
We'll have to find something else
for you to call him sometime.

00:51:59.532 --> 00:52:03.620
You're right. It would be bad
if word gets out that he's alive.

00:52:05.913 --> 00:52:10.126
The only people who should kill
are those prepared to die themselves.

00:52:11.836 --> 00:52:15.840
Which is why I am not the one who
should be messing with the world.

00:52:17.592 --> 00:52:20.428
Besides, Lelouch vi Britannia is someone

00:52:20.637 --> 00:52:23.848
who abandoned his existence,
along with the rest of the world.

00:52:25.892 --> 00:52:28.811
That's why, just this once,

00:52:29.020 --> 00:52:32.315
to save Suzaku and rescue Nunnally,

00:52:34.108 --> 00:52:39.030
| will become Zero again,
as Lelouch Lamperouge.

00:52:52.752 --> 00:52:56.255
Well, this is strange.
| wonder what's happened to C.C.

00:52:56.464 --> 00:52:58.132
Shirley!

00:52:58.341 --> 00:53:00.677
Prez! How was Zilkhstan?

00:53:00.885 --> 00:53:04.263
No good. They gave me
almost no press access. Right?

00:53:04.472 --> 00:53:08.559
I'm not sure what happened,
but things got dicey, so we came back.

00:53:08.768 --> 00:53:10.520
Oh, that was probably the right call.

00:53:10.728 --> 00:53:11.562
How so?

00:53:11.771 --> 00:53:15.483
There are rumors on the internet
that foreigners in Zilkhstan

00:53:15.692 --> 00:53:17.568
keep getting locked up, one after the next.

00:53:17.777 --> 00:53:18.194
Huh?

00:53:18.403 --> 00:53:21.531
Ah! They say the
airports could be shut down, too!

00:53:32.333 --> 00:53:34.460
| thought it sounded far-fetched,

00:53:34.669 --> 00:53:37.672
but it looks like the reports
of you being alive were true,

00:53:37.880 --> 00:53:41.509
Lelouch. And you, too, Suzaku.

00:53:41.718 --> 00:53:44.011
You're on the run from
your pursuers in Zilkhstan,

00:53:44.220 --> 00:53:47.598
and managed to make it all the way
here to this village, right on the border.

00:53:47.807 --> 00:53:51.769
But Lelouch, I cannot allow you to
enter the United Federation of Nations.

00:53:51.978 --> 00:53:53.896
Will you die here or turn back?

00:53:54.105 --> 00:53:56.858
Sister, you are mistaken.

00:53:57.066 --> 00:54:01.738
| have not fled here;
| came here to join up with you.

00:54:01.946 --> 00:54:05.408
Enough of your nonsense!
You are going to die again here.

00:54:05.616 --> 00:54:07.243
Just a moment, please!

00:54:07.452 --> 00:54:09.620
Are you really Zero?

00:54:09.829 --> 00:54:11.789
We've made certain.

00:54:11.998 --> 00:54:13.583
It's him, without a doubt.

00:54:13.791 --> 00:54:15.793
And just to add to that,

00:54:16.002 --> 00:54:17.545
we're witnesses, as well.

00:54:17.754 --> 00:54:20.548
Master Lelouch, we received word
from Undersecretary Kannon

00:54:20.757 --> 00:54:24.635
that additional Knightmares
would be arriving by air.

00:54:24.844 --> 00:54:25.636
Good.

00:54:25.845 --> 00:54:30.725
I'd like you to all work under my orders
for a mission to recapture Nunnally.

00:54:30.933 --> 00:54:33.436
We believe she is being held
at de Mu Base in the capital,

00:54:33.644 --> 00:54:37.732
the rock-hewn church at Mefeng,
or somewhere else in the area.

00:54:37.940 --> 00:54:40.735
We want to get Nunnally back, as well.

00:54:40.943 --> 00:54:45.323
But this country has 12,000 men
enlisted to defend their capital.

00:54:45.531 --> 00:54:48.951
We, on the other hand, have about 20,
if you count the civilians.

00:54:49.160 --> 00:54:52.872
You can have a special team for the
purpose of field surveys and advance retrieval.

00:54:53.080 --> 00:54:54.499
| can't give you more than that.

00:54:54.707 --> 00:54:57.210
Which means the enemy outnumbers us...

00:54:57.418 --> 00:54:58.503
About 600-to-1.

00:54:58.711 --> 00:55:00.671
Huh? What the hell?!

00:55:00.880 --> 00:55:03.466
Zero, we don't have enough supplies!
There's no way!

00:55:03.674 --> 00:55:08.095
We're only saving Nunnally.
There's no need to kill all 12,000 of them.

00:55:08.304 --> 00:55:11.390
Don't make it sound so easy.
This is the country of warriors,

00:55:11.599 --> 00:55:15.311
who once defeated a
Britannian army with limited numbers.

00:55:15.520 --> 00:55:18.231
What's more, this is the enemy's land.
They have the geographical advantage.

00:55:18.439 --> 00:55:20.817
Our being here at all right now is dangerous.

00:55:21.025 --> 00:55:23.027
We should leave here,
and try the diplomatic route.

00:55:23.236 --> 00:55:27.365
And? Do you think that
will go well without me?

00:55:27.573 --> 00:55:29.492
Let me ask you again.

00:55:29.700 --> 00:55:33.788
After taking the lives of many people,
including Euphie and Dalton,

00:55:33.996 --> 00:55:37.333
are you now trying to get us killed, too?

00:55:37.542 --> 00:55:40.461
All to fulfill your personal wish?

00:55:46.759 --> 00:55:50.680
Please. I need your help.

00:55:50.888 --> 00:55:53.057
| can't save Nunnally by myself.

00:55:53.266 --> 00:55:55.726
I'm going to need your help, as well.

00:55:57.270 --> 00:55:59.021
It's a selfish request.

00:55:59.230 --> 00:56:00.606
If we do offer you our help...

00:56:00.815 --> 00:56:02.024
...then we will prevail.

00:56:02.233 --> 00:56:04.694
Are your words true?

00:56:04.902 --> 00:56:09.490
| will not lie to you anymore.
| have no need to.

00:56:11.534 --> 00:56:15.454
| don't know about Lelouch, but I trust Zero.

00:56:15.663 --> 00:56:17.540
Ohgi...

00:56:17.748 --> 00:56:20.960
| once failed to trust Zero completely,
and took some wrong turns.

00:56:21.168 --> 00:56:23.921
If I could do it over again,
| wouldn't stray this time.

00:56:24.130 --> 00:56:28.801
I'm with Zero! I know the
guy can work miracles, after all!

00:56:30.845 --> 00:56:35.474
We may not share a mother,
but Nunnally is unquestionably my sister.

00:56:35.683 --> 00:56:38.603
So how do we have any
other choice but to rescue her?

00:56:38.811 --> 00:56:41.522
Yes, Your Highness!

00:56:41.731 --> 00:56:42.857
Thanks.

00:56:44.275 --> 00:56:48.070
All right! So what do you say we have
a party to celebrate the way forward?

00:56:48.279 --> 00:56:49.238
Yeah!

00:56:49.447 --> 00:56:52.199
--All right, you guys, bring some whiskey!
--We don't have anything but canned goods for food, though.

00:56:52.408 --> 00:56:54.952
--There should be some White Fang in the #3 container.
--We do have some Britannian Z-rations.

00:56:55.161 --> 00:56:56.370
Yes, sir!

00:57:03.669 --> 00:57:06.505
We're here to contribute
to the effort as civilians.

00:57:06.714 --> 00:57:12.053
Jeremiah Gottwald and Anya Alstreim.
It is a pleasure working with you.

00:57:12.261 --> 00:57:15.014
It is... a pleasure.

00:57:15.222 --> 00:57:18.976
Do the extra Knightmares
that Kannon sent belong to you?

00:57:19.185 --> 00:57:21.687
Yes, to give support to Lelouch.

00:57:21.896 --> 00:57:23.606
Welcome. Let's give it our best.

00:57:23.814 --> 00:57:27.109
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:57:27.693 --> 00:57:28.277
"Zero"

00:57:28.277 --> 00:57:31.489
"Zero"
Yo, Guilford...

00:57:31.489 --> 00:57:31.697
"Zero"

00:57:31.697 --> 00:57:35.910
"Zero"
Guilford, why are you passing out bribes?

00:57:35.910 --> 00:57:36.118
"Zero"

00:57:36.118 --> 00:57:37.370
"Zero"
Oh, this is just to thank them for their help.

00:57:37.370 --> 00:57:39.288
Oh, this is just to thank them for their help.

00:57:39.497 --> 00:57:43.250
Ha! They'd sell out their country for money?

00:57:43.459 --> 00:57:46.921
It's all they can do
to survive doing their own thing.

00:57:47.129 --> 00:57:48.798
There's a lot of that going around.

00:57:49.006 --> 00:57:53.511
That's right. If I achieve results here,
| can go back to the center.

00:57:53.719 --> 00:57:55.888
With a huge budget and tons of power!

00:57:56.097 --> 00:57:58.307
You aren't doing this for Suzaku?

00:57:58.516 --> 00:58:00.393
Ha-ha, I'm only human.

00:58:00.601 --> 00:58:04.188
| understand.
That's the kind of person you are.

00:58:04.397 --> 00:58:08.484
Cécile, you really do
get Dr. Lloyd, don't you?

00:58:08.693 --> 00:58:10.027
Do 1?

00:58:13.489 --> 00:58:14.907
Dr. Lloyd?

00:58:15.116 --> 00:58:18.327
Uh-oh. Did you not like the taste?

00:58:18.536 --> 00:58:21.330
| brewed it using dragon's
breath chili and orange liqueur,

00:58:21.539 --> 00:58:24.083
with some starch thrown in to thicken it up.

00:58:24.291 --> 00:58:26.293
What's that smell?

00:58:26.502 --> 00:58:28.379
| added some durian for a little zest.

00:58:32.591 --> 00:58:35.553
Are you sure you don't
want to talk to Lelouch?

00:58:35.761 --> 00:58:40.516
Yeah, you know, I have no idea
what I'd talk to him about anymore.

00:58:40.725 --> 00:58:44.228
Best not to assume that you'll see him
again tomorrow like it's nothing.

00:58:44.437 --> 00:58:45.146
Hmm?

00:58:45.354 --> 00:58:49.358
If you have anything you
want to tell him, don't put it off.

00:58:49.567 --> 00:58:52.278
Well, what about you?

00:58:52.486 --> 00:58:56.157
You've lived so long, putting
things off is a matter of course, isn't it?

00:59:01.579 --> 00:59:06.542
Also, this is from Lady Kaguya.
In case you really were alive, she said.

00:59:06.751 --> 00:59:08.085
Is that so?

00:59:08.294 --> 00:59:13.174
You know, Ohgi, I wouldn't
have thought you'd come along.

00:59:13.382 --> 00:59:16.844
A topographical map of Zilkhstan.
This will be helpful.

00:59:17.053 --> 00:59:19.930
Um... Thank you, Zero.

00:59:20.139 --> 00:59:24.060
It's thanks to you that the
nation of Japan is what it is now.

00:59:24.268 --> 00:59:25.770
Please accept this as my apology.

00:59:25.978 --> 00:59:27.104
Stop.

00:59:28.731 --> 00:59:31.817
All of that is in the past.

00:59:36.322 --> 00:59:38.449
I'm so glad you're all right, Kururugi.

00:59:38.657 --> 00:59:41.911
Huh? Oh... thank you.

00:59:42.828 --> 00:59:44.121
Two Zeros, huh?

00:59:44.330 --> 00:59:45.664
Just for now.

00:59:46.916 --> 00:59:48.375
What do you mean, just for now?

00:59:48.584 --> 00:59:50.920
There should only be one Zero.

00:59:51.128 --> 00:59:55.758
Such a figure already exceeds
the framework of a limited world.

01:00:01.555 --> 01:00:04.600
Ah, I knew you'd be up here,

01:00:04.809 --> 01:00:05.601
Lelouch.

01:00:05.810 --> 01:00:07.812
You looked like you wanted to talk.

01:00:08.020 --> 01:00:10.064
There are two things I'd like to say.

01:00:10.272 --> 01:00:13.317
The first is that, Lelouch,
now that you're back,

01:00:13.526 --> 01:00:14.944
you're the one who should be Zero.

01:00:15.152 --> 01:00:16.904
You're Zero now.

01:00:17.113 --> 01:00:20.533
I'm just window dressing.
You're the one it should be.

01:00:20.741 --> 01:00:24.328
What is it with all of you?
Give up on wishing me back.

01:00:24.537 --> 01:00:27.790
How can we think like that
when you're right here in front of us?

01:00:27.998 --> 01:00:29.667
I'm only passing through.

01:00:29.875 --> 01:00:30.543
Huh?

01:00:30.751 --> 01:00:33.546
| don't know the rules of Cs' World.

01:00:33.754 --> 01:00:36.549
| may not still be here tomorrow.

01:00:36.757 --> 01:00:37.716
Oh, no...

01:00:37.925 --> 01:00:41.637
What was the other thing
you wanted to say? Make it quick.

01:00:41.846 --> 01:00:44.056
| have to put the mission together,

01:00:44.265 --> 01:00:48.185
and I need you to recover
as much strength as you can.

01:00:49.687 --> 01:00:50.688
What is it?

01:00:50.896 --> 01:00:53.816
Oh, within this data
| received from Kaguya...

01:00:53.816 --> 01:00:54.275
II3II Oh, within this data
| received from Kaguya...

01:00:54.275 --> 01:00:54.608
"3"

01:00:54.817 --> 01:00:55.609
"2"

01:00:55.818 --> 01:00:56.819
II1 n

01:00:59.864 --> 01:01:05.286
Ah, Ohgi's reception. Everyone got back
together after being apart for so long.

01:01:06.996 --> 01:01:08.497
What a pity!

01:01:08.706 --> 01:01:10.374
You have our congratulations!

01:01:10.583 --> 01:01:12.418
And our condolences!

01:01:13.919 --> 01:01:16.922
Are you two both drunk?!

01:01:17.131 --> 01:01:18.215
I'm so sorry!

01:01:18.424 --> 01:01:21.177
Who would have called it?
Ohgi and Villetta...

01:01:21.385 --> 01:01:25.514
It's a good thing for a man to settle down.

01:01:26.557 --> 01:01:30.477
| hope to attend a party
you're the star of sometime.

01:01:30.686 --> 01:01:32.771
Huh? Oh, don't be silly--

01:01:35.649 --> 01:01:39.361
Ms. Villetta, how does it feel
to be living the Cinderella story?

01:01:39.570 --> 01:01:39.945
Uh...

01:01:40.154 --> 01:01:42.072
You can't ask her like that!

01:01:42.281 --> 01:01:46.035
Yeah, but come on, you could have
thrown a bigger bash than this, right?!

01:01:46.243 --> 01:01:46.952
Oh, there are still--

01:01:47.161 --> 01:01:49.747
Allow me to offer my congratulations.

01:01:49.955 --> 01:01:54.335
This is Kannon Maldini, from
down at the other end of the table.

01:01:54.543 --> 01:01:58.255
Nunnally, the Schwarzwélder
Kirschtorte is delicious.

01:01:58.464 --> 01:02:00.132
Ah, you think so?

01:02:00.341 --> 01:02:03.761
Don't you think it's rude not
to address her as Lady Nunnally?

01:02:03.969 --> 01:02:08.098
Oh, it's all right.
Just "Nunnally” is fine. Right?

01:02:10.309 --> 01:02:12.186
This is the world that you saved.

01:02:12.394 --> 01:02:14.230
Kaguya, you sneak.

01:02:14.438 --> 01:02:17.691
Lelouch, the other thing
| wanted to say to you...

01:02:19.693 --> 01:02:22.029
...is that I'm glad you're alive.

01:02:23.364 --> 01:02:26.158
Well, it was a pretty
rough reunion, considering.

01:02:26.367 --> 01:02:30.871
A world without you was
a lot more lonesome than I expected.

01:02:31.080 --> 01:02:34.124
Hmm. Thanks for that.

01:02:34.333 --> 01:02:35.584
Also, about Nunnally...

01:02:35.793 --> 01:02:40.547
| know. That's another reason
why this rescue mission must succeed.

01:02:40.756 --> 01:02:43.884
With both of us together,
there's no fight we can't win.

01:02:44.093 --> 01:02:46.929
True enough. We'll win for sure.

01:02:56.563 --> 01:03:00.317
Let me see your permit.
After that, I need to check your cargo.

01:03:00.526 --> 01:03:02.611
The cargo belongs to the Black Knights.

01:03:02.820 --> 01:03:03.862
Huh?

01:03:04.071 --> 01:03:06.240
We're going to use them
to blockade the capital.

01:03:06.448 --> 01:03:09.576
For the duration of this operation,
you're going to be my men.

01:03:09.785 --> 01:03:12.454
What are you, a spy--?!

01:03:18.294 --> 01:03:19.837
--Namjala latak.
--Namjala latak.

01:03:30.264 --> 01:03:35.602
All right, I will now explain to you your
roles during the Nunnally rescue mission.

01:03:35.811 --> 01:03:37.313
You'll go into action at 00:00 hours.

01:03:37.521 --> 01:03:40.649
Uprisings will break out
at four bases near the capital.

01:03:40.858 --> 01:03:43.402
There will also be radar jamming in place.

01:03:43.610 --> 01:03:46.488
The squad centered around Cornelia
will use Knightmares and the like

01:03:46.697 --> 01:03:48.449
to keep the enemy off-balance.

01:03:48.657 --> 01:03:51.618
Sayoko's team will find the
location where Nunnally is being held

01:03:51.827 --> 01:03:53.037
based on the enemy's movements.

01:03:53.245 --> 01:03:54.163
Understood.

01:03:54.371 --> 01:03:55.414
Suzaku and Kallen?

01:03:55.622 --> 01:03:57.541
Already in position.

01:03:58.876 --> 01:04:00.544
Is yours going to work?

01:04:00.753 --> 01:04:02.504
It's been a while, but I'll be fine.

01:04:02.713 --> 01:04:04.923
I'm more concerned
about this additional armor.

01:04:05.132 --> 01:04:07.801
That's something
we'll just have to use and see.

01:04:08.969 --> 01:04:09.845
What?

01:04:10.054 --> 01:04:13.724
| never thought the day would come
when we'd be chatting like this.

01:04:16.518 --> 01:04:18.228
It's time.

01:04:28.280 --> 01:04:32.409
Now, make your move,
whoever abducted Nunnally,

01:04:32.618 --> 01:04:34.203
you foolish mastermind.

01:04:34.411 --> 01:04:36.747
Communications with
Ajbeq Base have been cut off.

01:04:36.955 --> 01:04:39.333
No response from the
Ginujaya 113th Knightmare Squad.

01:04:39.541 --> 01:04:42.378
An uprising? Or is it the Black Knights?

01:04:42.586 --> 01:04:45.923
Big sister, I'll take care
of defending the temple rear.

01:04:46.131 --> 01:04:49.426
Be careful. Until we know who the enemy is...

01:04:49.635 --> 01:04:54.932
It's all right. Once I'm inside my Knightmare,
| can move about freely.

01:04:55.849 --> 01:04:58.477
Forgnar, you have defense of the seaward side.

01:04:58.685 --> 01:04:59.686
Yes, Majesty.

01:04:59.895 --> 01:05:01.105
Princess,

01:05:01.313 --> 01:05:04.191
are you sure we can trust this plan?

01:05:04.400 --> 01:05:06.693
Is there any other way?

01:05:07.945 --> 01:05:13.242
Namjala latak. I will come through
for you with all that I have.

01:05:21.083 --> 01:05:24.128
All right, Jeremiah, in five minutes,
your men will move to the gulf district

01:05:24.336 --> 01:05:25.546
and divide the enemy's number.

01:05:25.754 --> 01:05:27.297
Understood.

01:05:44.314 --> 01:05:45.315
Mr. Qujappat?

01:05:45.524 --> 01:05:49.653
Princess Shamna ordered me
to join the city's guard.

01:05:52.990 --> 01:05:55.367
A national state of
emergency has been declared

01:05:55.576 --> 01:05:57.995
based on sovereign
defense emergency protocols.

01:05:58.203 --> 01:06:00.205
All officers and soldiers, devote every effort

01:06:00.414 --> 01:06:02.791
toward securing and maintaining
command and control.

01:06:03.000 --> 01:06:06.545
The people for me, and I for the people.

01:06:06.753 --> 01:06:10.674
King Shalio, the advance force on
the Gimsula Plains has been wiped out.

01:06:10.883 --> 01:06:12.634
Wiped out?

01:06:28.567 --> 01:06:32.779
You had your warning.
If you're still going to keep coming...

01:06:48.212 --> 01:06:51.089
Wow. You're getting the
hang of it, aren't you, Suzaku?

01:06:51.298 --> 01:06:54.343
That name belongs
to a dead man. I am now...

01:06:54.551 --> 01:06:57.137
As far as I'm concerned,
Zero is not just a symbol.

01:06:57.346 --> 01:07:00.641
So for you to take on that name...

01:07:03.435 --> 01:07:05.812
...is a bit of a problem for me.

01:07:15.322 --> 01:07:17.658
Due to electrical supply stability measures,

01:07:17.866 --> 01:07:21.036
power to Category 3 and Category 4
facilities will be cut in 60 seconds.

01:07:21.245 --> 01:07:24.414
Wow, the power of Geass is incredible!

01:07:24.623 --> 01:07:27.125
We got into the ministry so easily!

01:07:27.334 --> 01:07:28.627
| need your report first.

01:07:28.835 --> 01:07:30.587
Right. Nina?

01:07:30.796 --> 01:07:32.172
Just a moment, please.

01:07:32.381 --> 01:07:35.592
Nothing especially stands out
from either ground or air routes.

01:07:35.801 --> 01:07:37.427
Anya is covering the sea routes.

01:07:37.636 --> 01:07:41.598
The temple! Power and such
is being prioritized to the temple!

01:07:41.807 --> 01:07:44.935
The temple? Do they think
they're pulling a fast one?

01:07:45.143 --> 01:07:48.564
All right, we capture the king's sister,
Shamna, in the temple,

01:07:48.772 --> 01:07:50.274
and hold her hostage.

01:07:54.403 --> 01:07:56.822
C.C., if there are any Geass
users inside, you'll deal with them.

01:07:57.030 --> 01:07:57.698
Got it.

01:07:57.906 --> 01:08:00.200
Princess Shamna, it's too dangerous here!
You must evacuate!

01:08:00.409 --> 01:08:05.581
There's no need. Right now,
we must hurry to complete the system.

01:08:15.340 --> 01:08:18.844
Surrender, if the name
Zero holds any dread for you.

01:08:19.052 --> 01:08:25.350
Impressive. Shalio thought you were
the supposedly dead Suzaku Kururugi,

01:08:25.559 --> 01:08:28.812
but you're someone else?
Or are there many of you?

01:08:29.021 --> 01:08:31.315
| have no intention of
engaging you in conversation.

01:08:31.523 --> 01:08:33.609
My business is with Nunnally alone.

01:08:33.817 --> 01:08:35.986
If you surrender, I won't kill you.

01:08:36.194 --> 01:08:39.072
Unless you want your
country destroyed, do as I say.

01:08:39.281 --> 01:08:42.784
You won't kill me?
Hm-hm, surrender is out of the question.

01:08:42.993 --> 01:08:44.995
You don't wish to spare your people?

01:08:45.203 --> 01:08:47.706
I'll say it again! Surrender!

01:08:47.914 --> 01:08:50.334
| think that woman has a Geass.

01:08:50.542 --> 01:08:51.877
| don't know what her power is.

01:08:52.085 --> 01:08:53.003
| see.

01:08:53.211 --> 01:08:54.921
Six hours ago,

01:08:55.130 --> 01:08:59.051
| believe I was right in the middle of a bath.

01:08:59.259 --> 01:09:00.636
Damn you!

01:09:04.931 --> 01:09:10.520
My country's warriors would
never lose in a fair fight.

01:09:12.522 --> 01:09:14.691
I'll see you later.

01:09:29.539 --> 01:09:34.294
Once again, my life has
been reset by six hours.

01:09:34.503 --> 01:09:35.879
What is it, big sister?

01:09:36.088 --> 01:09:37.714
Just a moment, okay?

01:09:37.923 --> 01:09:39.549
Connect me with Forgnar.

01:09:39.758 --> 01:09:41.218
You've received another prophecy?

01:09:41.426 --> 01:09:42.594
Yes.

01:09:43.637 --> 01:09:46.139
Princess? This is Forgnar.

01:09:46.348 --> 01:09:50.560
Listen to me closely.
In six hours--no, a little before that--

01:09:50.769 --> 01:09:51.895
There will be an uprising.

01:09:52.104 --> 01:09:53.313
An uprising?

01:09:53.522 --> 01:09:55.565
There will be Black Knight
Knightmares involved,

01:09:55.774 --> 01:09:58.402
so it may be some kind of ploy.

01:09:58.610 --> 01:10:02.364
| will give you more details later.
First, have the alert level raised.

01:10:02.572 --> 01:10:06.576
Namjala latak. All will be as you prophesy.

01:10:08.245 --> 01:10:13.750
Zero, even if you have the master
on your side, you can never beat me.

01:10:13.959 --> 01:10:17.587
I, Shamna, am destined
to relive my life every time I die.

01:10:17.796 --> 01:10:21.091
No matter what move you make,
my layers of experience

01:10:21.299 --> 01:10:24.344
will rebuild Zilkhstan.

01:10:24.553 --> 01:10:25.429
Big sister?

01:10:25.637 --> 01:10:29.933
Shalio, the fact that
| am of no help to our nation

01:10:30.142 --> 01:10:33.937
and that I must depend upon you,
is something I cannot abide.

01:10:34.146 --> 01:10:36.898
You really don't have to worry about me.

01:10:37.107 --> 01:10:40.068
No, the world is wrong.

01:10:40.277 --> 01:10:44.573
With the power of my prophecies,
| will correct the world.

01:10:56.501 --> 01:10:59.671
Enemy armed forces in
Majbeq Station 2 have been eradicated.

01:10:59.880 --> 01:11:03.258
Dissidents at Radar Site 3 have been pacified.

01:11:03.467 --> 01:11:08.889
Leave it to big sister's prophecy.
But will the fleeing Zero really show up?

01:11:09.097 --> 01:11:12.809
Princess, should we issue an emergency alert?

01:11:13.018 --> 01:11:16.313
To make it look like the enemy's plot
is going better than it is.

01:11:16.521 --> 01:11:18.523
And uncover the remaining enemies?

01:11:18.732 --> 01:11:19.566
Yes.

01:11:19.775 --> 01:11:22.694
An emergency alert has just been issued.

01:11:22.903 --> 01:11:27.699
Please remain indoors.
Repeat, an emergency alert has been issued...

01:11:29.159 --> 01:11:30.660
What?!

01:11:35.957 --> 01:11:38.210
It can't be! Our lord's plan...

01:11:38.418 --> 01:11:39.252
...has been anticipated?!

01:11:39.461 --> 01:11:42.297
Yeah! They're lying in wait for us all over!

01:11:42.506 --> 01:11:44.674
What do we do, Zero?!

01:11:45.842 --> 01:11:48.804
We never should have come here!

01:11:49.012 --> 01:11:50.847
The plan has been revealed! But how?!

01:11:51.056 --> 01:11:54.142
Hey, the entire area around the
temple has been declared off-limits!

01:11:54.351 --> 01:11:56.186
Oh, Excellency...

01:11:56.394 --> 01:11:56.812
What?!

01:11:57.020 --> 01:11:57.813
You see...

01:11:58.021 --> 01:12:00.315
Our facility has been put on lockdown.

01:12:00.524 --> 01:12:03.652
Who did this?
My entire plan has been seen through.

01:12:03.860 --> 01:12:07.572
This country may have tacticians and
politicians, but no one this resourceful.

01:12:07.781 --> 01:12:08.615
Oh, no!

01:12:08.824 --> 01:12:11.910
The two I used as a diversion
in place of a gun battery!

01:12:15.747 --> 01:12:19.417
Having nothing to do until mission time is--

01:12:23.839 --> 01:12:26.466
Ha-ha-ha, they really were here!

01:12:26.675 --> 01:12:33.473
The fools! If they want to take me
on in my Batalalan Du, then...

01:12:40.397 --> 01:12:43.984
Kallen! Get some distance! I'll use my PNC--

01:12:48.989 --> 01:12:50.156
It's him...

01:12:50.365 --> 01:12:54.244
All you have to do is get in close enough
on a long-range Knight Gigafortress.

01:12:54.452 --> 01:12:56.621
But in this case...!

01:13:01.084 --> 01:13:01.877
Why, you...

01:13:02.085 --> 01:13:04.087
| caught you! And now...

01:13:04.296 --> 01:13:06.506
<i>Megistos Omega!</i>

01:13:14.097 --> 01:13:17.642
This is bad! The weight of
this thing is working against me!

01:13:17.851 --> 01:13:20.562
Suzaku! Come in! Kallen!

01:13:21.688 --> 01:13:24.274
Oh! Could this be E.C.M.?

01:13:24.482 --> 01:13:27.527
What do we do?
We have to retrieve the data, at least.

01:13:27.736 --> 01:13:28.945
Let's get out of here.

01:13:29.154 --> 01:13:31.698
If Zero's strategy has been anticipated,

01:13:31.907 --> 01:13:35.243
then fleeing by air would be
that much more dangerous, right?

01:13:35.452 --> 01:13:37.495
Hmm...

01:13:39.205 --> 01:13:41.917
Princess, I will return to our leader, then.

01:13:42.125 --> 01:13:45.754
Mm-hmm. Tell him that we're
on our way to charge the castle

01:13:45.962 --> 01:13:47.714
and create a disturbance.

01:13:52.510 --> 01:13:53.511
Princess!

01:13:56.056 --> 01:13:58.308
They knew about this operation?!

01:13:58.516 --> 01:14:01.978
Ho, is that unit the "Witch of Britannia"?

01:14:02.187 --> 01:14:06.858
Bolvona Forgnar, the Brown Bulwark himself.

01:14:07.067 --> 01:14:08.777
Too slow.

01:14:10.737 --> 01:14:15.992
S-Sayoko... wait up... Ow... my knee...!

01:14:16.201 --> 01:14:17.994
Ah, they're here!

01:14:19.663 --> 01:14:21.581
| cannot reach Master Zero.

01:14:21.790 --> 01:14:24.292
The rest of you, please run down
the shoreline and cross the border.

01:14:24.501 --> 01:14:27.045
I'm afraid I can't have that.

01:14:27.253 --> 01:14:30.465
Terrorists are to be crucified.

01:14:30.674 --> 01:14:31.758
By the way,

01:14:31.967 --> 01:14:36.262
do you know who are your allies
and who are your enemies?

01:14:46.398 --> 01:14:49.150
Miss Cécile? Miss Cécile!

01:14:49.359 --> 01:14:50.694
Huh?

01:14:50.902 --> 01:14:55.407
I'm all right. I can start the Knightmare...

01:15:02.330 --> 01:15:04.916
This situation...!

01:15:08.211 --> 01:15:11.923
Reports say that the terrorists'
command unit has been brought down.

01:15:12.132 --> 01:15:13.758
Very well.

01:15:22.684 --> 01:15:24.436
Did I manage to make it in time?

01:15:24.644 --> 01:15:27.105
Yeah. Thanks, Anya.

01:15:27.313 --> 01:15:30.567
Good. Jerry would be mad
if anything happened.

01:15:31.484 --> 01:15:34.487
Hey, can you get the hatch opened?
Hurry and switch over to mine.

01:15:34.696 --> 01:15:37.574
| thought I told you to stay along the border.
Why is the Gekkoei--

01:15:37.782 --> 01:15:40.243
Circumstances have changed,
so it was necessary.

01:15:40.452 --> 01:15:44.581
Sure, it's not quite finished and meant
to be covert, so its uses are limited--

01:15:51.629 --> 01:15:55.050
Who the hell could have so
completely seen through my plan?

01:15:55.258 --> 01:15:58.344
Should we gather intel on them?
Or should we pull back first?

01:15:58.553 --> 01:16:01.806
That would hang Suzaku, Kallen,
Cornelia, and the others out to dry.

01:16:02.015 --> 01:16:02.849
| know!

01:16:03.058 --> 01:16:07.520
Come up with a plan, Lelouch.
That is, if you want to get Nunnally back.

01:16:13.318 --> 01:16:15.111
It's in motion...

01:16:15.320 --> 01:16:18.823
The system that had come to
a halt after the changeover...

01:16:19.032 --> 01:16:23.203
Nunnally, because of you,
| can once again enter Cs' World.

01:16:23.411 --> 01:16:25.330
Now, where is it?

01:16:25.538 --> 01:16:30.210
The source, the provenance,
the origin of man's consciousness!

01:16:30.418 --> 01:16:34.631
Make me the first human,
and let us start fresh!

01:16:34.839 --> 01:16:39.094
Let me bring Zilkhstan, Shalio,
and our many people

01:16:39.302 --> 01:16:43.389
back into this world
in the form that I desire--

01:16:45.767 --> 01:16:46.684
Princess Shamna?

01:16:46.893 --> 01:16:50.438
You appear to have gone quite deep.
Are you all right?

01:16:50.647 --> 01:16:51.272
| can do it.

01:16:51.481 --> 01:16:52.190
Huh?

01:16:52.398 --> 01:16:54.901
I'm almost there.

01:16:55.110 --> 01:16:56.486
What are the terrorists doing?

01:16:56.694 --> 01:16:59.739
We received word from Generalissimo
Forgnar that they were all subdued.

01:16:59.948 --> 01:17:02.283
King Shalio does not appear
to have had any trouble, either.

01:17:02.492 --> 01:17:06.955
| see. A readjustment, please. At this point,

01:17:07.163 --> 01:17:09.082
| don't mind if Nunnally dies.

01:17:09.290 --> 01:17:11.126
--Namjala latak.
--Namjala latak.

01:17:15.255 --> 01:17:18.675
So Nunnally is in the
temple after all. But then...

01:17:18.883 --> 01:17:20.885
Hey, hurry up with your next orders.

01:17:21.094 --> 01:17:22.929
Orders? In the mess we're in?!

01:17:23.138 --> 01:17:23.888
Huh?

01:17:24.097 --> 01:17:27.142
Even if I wanted to change the mission,
radio communications are shut down.

01:17:27.350 --> 01:17:30.228
Further, even if they knew about my Geass,

01:17:30.436 --> 01:17:33.731
it's impossible for them to have known
what our forces and plans were!

01:17:33.940 --> 01:17:36.734
How am I supposed to fight
an opponent like that?!

01:17:43.241 --> 01:17:47.370
| can't keep up.
Needle marking... on both arms is out.

01:17:47.579 --> 01:17:55.044
The people for me, and |
for the people, will now best Zero!

01:17:59.841 --> 01:18:03.219
You can have one of my arms.
But in exchange...!

01:18:03.428 --> 01:18:04.888
You buffoon!

01:18:05.096 --> 01:18:07.098
That was a transparent move!

01:18:08.224 --> 01:18:10.810
Zero, what do I do?! Zero, your orders!

01:18:11.019 --> 01:18:14.981
Zero, I'm having trouble holding the line!
They're ambushing me!

01:18:17.901 --> 01:18:19.194
"Black Knights General Staff Headquarters”

01:18:19.194 --> 01:18:22.614
"Black Knights General Staff Headquarters” It appears
that our military secrets have been leaked to your side.

01:18:22.614 --> 01:18:22.822
"Black Knights General Staff Headquarters”

01:18:22.822 --> 01:18:24.073
"Black Knights General Staff Headquarters”
This is the first I've heard of it.

01:18:24.073 --> 01:18:24.240
This is the first I've heard of it.

01:18:24.449 --> 01:18:27.410
There are also reports
that you have had an uprising.

01:18:27.619 --> 01:18:29.120
It's a military exercise.

01:18:29.329 --> 01:18:31.039
Where is Mr. Shesthaal?

01:18:31.247 --> 01:18:33.499
He isn't feeling well.

01:18:33.708 --> 01:18:35.376
What about the search
for Miss Nunnally and Zero?!

01:18:35.585 --> 01:18:39.505
| believe it's impolite to ask
that of only our nation.

01:18:39.714 --> 01:18:42.759
It would be one thing if we had a treaty
with the United Federation of Nations,

01:18:42.967 --> 01:18:45.762
but why would the Black Knights
be involved in this matter?

01:18:45.970 --> 01:18:48.264
It is suspicious, isn't it?

01:18:52.477 --> 01:18:54.520
I'm pinned down. At this rate...

01:18:54.729 --> 01:18:57.982
What do we do? Tell me, what do we do?

01:18:59.192 --> 01:19:01.152
Contact Zero, would you?!

01:19:01.361 --> 01:19:04.948
What do you want me to tell you?
They're jamming communications.

01:19:08.451 --> 01:19:11.621
So this is where you are, my lord.

01:19:13.915 --> 01:19:14.999
| have a report.

01:19:15.208 --> 01:19:18.044
An emergency alert has been issued
for the area around the capital,

01:19:18.253 --> 01:19:21.339
but it appears to have been
a ploy to draw us all inside.

01:19:21.547 --> 01:19:22.507
What is our next move?

01:19:22.715 --> 01:19:26.052
Next? Next we... Next we...

01:19:26.261 --> 01:19:28.137
Give up?

01:19:30.139 --> 01:19:31.349
Under the circumstances...

01:19:31.557 --> 01:19:33.977
Things are desperate, is that it?

01:19:34.185 --> 01:19:35.770
Yeah.

01:19:37.397 --> 01:19:40.066
| was the same way.

01:19:40.275 --> 01:19:45.196
| was desperate, journeying
in search of even a pinhole of light.

01:19:45.405 --> 01:19:48.157
But even so, I never gave up.

01:19:48.366 --> 01:19:51.744
| was sure that someday,
| would bring you back, all that time.

01:19:51.953 --> 01:19:53.496
And now...

01:19:54.372 --> 01:19:57.542
This isn't the you that I wanted to get back!

01:19:57.750 --> 01:20:00.712
| wanted the pompous,
egotistical, overconfident one,

01:20:00.920 --> 01:20:04.465
the Lelouch who never, at any time, gave up.

01:20:08.428 --> 01:20:14.225
I'm sorry. I didn't...
mean to dump all of this on you.

01:20:14.434 --> 01:20:17.520
You can pull out. This is farewell.

01:20:17.729 --> 01:20:20.773
What a self-centered woman you are.

01:20:20.982 --> 01:20:25.028
All right, C.C. This enemy possesses a Geass.

01:20:25.236 --> 01:20:27.488
A Geass? How do you know?

01:20:27.697 --> 01:20:28.614
It's my hypothesis.

01:20:28.823 --> 01:20:32.618
Given that assumption,
we'll narrow down what their Geass does.

01:20:32.827 --> 01:20:37.332
If we're wrong, we'll just
re-think it from the start again.

01:20:37.540 --> 01:20:39.208
Oh, and one other thing...

01:20:39.417 --> 01:20:44.380
Rescuing Nunnally is non-negotiable.
We cannot leave that out.

01:20:50.553 --> 01:20:53.556
| got you now!

01:20:53.765 --> 01:20:54.807
You did it!

01:20:55.016 --> 01:20:57.310
But how are we going to contact Zero?

01:20:57.518 --> 01:21:00.772
Huh? That's simple, isn't it?

01:21:03.149 --> 01:21:05.985
Whichever you like.
Choose one of them and look over it.

01:21:06.194 --> 01:21:07.487
That will be our plan from here on.

01:21:07.695 --> 01:21:11.407
| get it. Only I will know the details, right?

01:21:11.616 --> 01:21:15.161
--Right. Geass doesn't work on you, after all.
--Zero! Hey, Zero! Zero!! Zero! Zero! Hey, Zero! Zero!!

01:21:15.161 --> 01:21:19.874
--The question now is, how do we tell the others what the first step is?
--Zero! Hey, Zero! Zero!! Zero! Zero! Hey, Zero! Zero!!

01:21:20.083 --> 01:21:22.794
What is that?
It's on military and civilian channels.

01:21:23.002 --> 01:21:27.757
Zero! It's me! It's me! Tamaki!
We took over an enemy Knightmare, and--

01:21:27.965 --> 01:21:29.008
You idiot!

01:21:29.217 --> 01:21:30.760
Stop blabbing everything
over enemy channels!

01:21:30.968 --> 01:21:31.761
Yeah, but...!

01:21:31.969 --> 01:21:34.263
You're hopeless! You're hopeless!

01:21:34.472 --> 01:21:35.723
No, you've done well!

01:21:35.932 --> 01:21:36.599
Huh?

01:21:36.808 --> 01:21:40.645
We have this available to us!
C.C., hack everything you can.

01:21:40.853 --> 01:21:42.271
Got it.

01:21:47.860 --> 01:21:53.783
Big sister, I've become the greatest.
Strong enough to protect you.

01:21:57.620 --> 01:22:00.081
Attention, everyone!

01:22:00.289 --> 01:22:02.208
My name is Zero.

01:22:02.417 --> 01:22:04.961
We are now entering
the final phase of the mission.

01:22:05.169 --> 01:22:08.131
There's another Zero? Which means...

01:22:08.339 --> 01:22:10.425
You really were in that one!

01:22:10.633 --> 01:22:12.552
Over a Zilkhstani channel?

01:22:12.760 --> 01:22:15.304
But what is the "final" phase?

01:22:16.806 --> 01:22:18.850
My name is Zero.

01:22:19.058 --> 01:22:21.894
Those of you who stand with me,

01:22:22.103 --> 01:22:24.772
we are now entering
the final phase of the mission!

01:22:24.981 --> 01:22:29.152
It makes sense. Now the radio
interference doesn't matter.

01:22:29.360 --> 01:22:33.072
But what is the "final" stage?
Does he mean the last part of the operation?

01:22:33.281 --> 01:22:34.824
Or is it some new strategy?

01:22:35.032 --> 01:22:36.325
My lord?

01:22:36.534 --> 01:22:38.453
Should we strike back?

01:22:38.661 --> 01:22:41.080
So, what is the "final" phase?

01:22:41.289 --> 01:22:46.002
It doesn't mean anything.
Though I doubt the enemy will think so.

01:22:46.210 --> 01:22:47.920
That's what I'm talking about.

01:22:48.129 --> 01:22:49.130
Attack pattern?

01:22:49.338 --> 01:22:54.844
Already chosen. But before we do this,
won't our allies be confused by this?

01:22:55.052 --> 01:22:58.556
Not a problem. All that's left is
to narrow down the conditions.

01:22:58.764 --> 01:23:02.768
Damn you, Zero.
You deliberately announced yourself.

01:23:02.977 --> 01:23:06.647
Notify all forces that guarding
the perimeter has top priority.

01:23:06.856 --> 01:23:10.943
What is this "final" operation?
| haven't heard a thing about it.

01:23:11.152 --> 01:23:12.695
It's a trick.

01:23:12.904 --> 01:23:15.323
Doing this should diminish
the enemy's actions for now.

01:23:15.531 --> 01:23:19.285
It's an order to take
advantage of that to regroup.

01:23:19.494 --> 01:23:24.081
You do remember that my brother
never knows when to quit, right?

01:23:26.792 --> 01:23:28.794
Their commander is slow to give up.

01:23:38.804 --> 01:23:41.390
Princess Shamna,
message from Generalissimo Forgnar

01:23:41.599 --> 01:23:44.227
requesting that you
evacuate to Udunmu Base.

01:23:44.435 --> 01:23:46.229
He expects me to run now?

01:23:46.437 --> 01:23:49.065
We do not know exactly
how many terrorists there are,

01:23:49.273 --> 01:23:51.275
and there was that announcement earlier.

01:23:51.484 --> 01:23:52.652
The Fifth Fleet?

01:23:52.860 --> 01:23:56.197
Yes, Highness. If Chief of Staff
Schneizel is joining up with them,

01:23:56.405 --> 01:23:58.533
the United Federation
of Nations means business.

01:24:03.538 --> 01:24:08.167
Isn't this a little unusual?
Mr. Shesthaal isn't coming on anymore, either.

01:24:08.376 --> 01:24:11.170
All right, C.C., you're in command
for the rest of the mission.

01:24:11.379 --> 01:24:12.296
All right.

01:24:12.505 --> 01:24:15.967
Although you did come up
with this plan in the first place.

01:24:16.175 --> 01:24:19.929
CIC to Rook 1: Execute as planned,
focusing on urban areas.

01:24:20.137 --> 01:24:22.056
Rook 1, copy.

01:24:22.265 --> 01:24:27.061
Why are the terrorists using our channels?
We're hearing their whole plan!

01:24:27.270 --> 01:24:28.229
What is it?

01:24:28.437 --> 01:24:31.566
Princess Shamna, it's too dangerous here.
Please make your getaway.

01:24:31.774 --> 01:24:33.568
This operation is more important right now.

01:24:33.776 --> 01:24:36.404
| cannot allow it to cost you your life.

01:24:36.612 --> 01:24:38.906
| will take you to the castle first--

01:24:41.075 --> 01:24:45.162
Should I intercept the
terrorists' aerial units first...?

01:24:49.917 --> 01:24:51.627
What about the search
for Miss Nunnally and Zero?!

01:24:51.836 --> 01:24:55.756
| believe it's impolite
to ask that of only our nation.

01:24:55.965 --> 01:24:58.968
It would be one thing if we had a treaty
with the United Federation of Nations,

01:24:59.176 --> 01:25:01.971
but why would the Black Knights
be involved in this matter?

01:25:03.514 --> 01:25:07.935
Rook 1 to CIC. Enemy forces
are deployed around the target area.

01:25:08.144 --> 01:25:09.687
Executing the mission will be difficult.

01:25:09.895 --> 01:25:13.441
They even know our infiltration routes?
In that case, our next move...

01:25:13.649 --> 01:25:17.778
CIC to Rook 1. Abort mission.
Rendezvous here.

01:25:17.987 --> 01:25:21.907
CIC to Bishop 1. Carry out your assignment.

01:25:22.116 --> 01:25:23.951
Very well.

01:25:24.952 --> 01:25:28.623
Experience my loyal heart!

01:25:29.749 --> 01:25:31.417
Electricity from the
power plant has been cut off.

01:25:31.626 --> 01:25:34.003
Princess Shamna, just a moment, please!

01:25:34.211 --> 01:25:38.716
They went after the substation.
No time to wait for them to restart.

01:25:46.474 --> 01:25:47.558
Wha--?!

01:25:47.767 --> 01:25:51.562
CIC, they were lying in wait for me.
I am now falling back.

01:25:51.771 --> 01:25:53.064
That didn't work either.

01:25:53.272 --> 01:25:55.024
| don't know the details of the mission.

01:25:55.232 --> 01:25:59.737
Yeah. I'm the only one who knows,
but Geass doesn't work on me.

01:25:59.945 --> 01:26:01.906
Which means that the enemy's Geass

01:26:02.114 --> 01:26:04.325
isn't the sort that reads
a specific person's thoughts.

01:26:04.533 --> 01:26:06.702
Also, whoever possesses the Geass

01:26:06.911 --> 01:26:08.788
is someone who can manipulate
the country at will

01:26:08.996 --> 01:26:10.706
or someone next to them.

01:26:10.915 --> 01:26:12.708
Are you suggesting it's Shalio, the king?

01:26:12.917 --> 01:26:15.920
No. He's too fixated on Suzaku.

01:26:16.128 --> 01:26:19.131
The princess, Shamna, and Forgnar,
in the castle, are more suspect.

01:26:19.340 --> 01:26:22.551
For now, we should engage Aegis mode
and move on to the next plan.

01:26:22.760 --> 01:26:24.720
Hmm? Yeah.

01:26:26.681 --> 01:26:30.017
Something is off. Despite this
nation having abducted Nunnally,

01:26:30.226 --> 01:26:32.061
they haven't made use
of any of her intelligence.

01:26:32.269 --> 01:26:34.814
Which would mean that
Nunnally herself is the objective.

01:26:35.022 --> 01:26:37.024
But what kind of move is that?

01:26:37.233 --> 01:26:39.110
It's as though they don't care
if they lose their country.

01:26:39.318 --> 01:26:45.157
Wait, if they achieve their wish,
the country won't be lost? Then...

01:26:45.366 --> 01:26:47.868
Hey, they beat us to the punch here, too.

01:26:48.077 --> 01:26:49.495
With a cover over the vents,

01:26:49.704 --> 01:26:52.081
a gas attack on the temple
will take too much time.

01:26:52.289 --> 01:26:53.541
What do we do?

01:26:54.625 --> 01:26:56.585
That looks like terribly rushed work.

01:26:59.547 --> 01:27:03.217
It looks like the Black Knights
will be striking here in four hours.

01:27:03.426 --> 01:27:06.637
What do we do? Order Suzaku and
the others to fall back until the main force--

01:27:06.846 --> 01:27:07.722
No.

01:27:07.930 --> 01:27:11.517
If we pull back now, they'll just
tighten their defense of Nunnally.

01:27:11.726 --> 01:27:15.062
C.C., find out how many
hours ago this work was carried out.

01:27:15.271 --> 01:27:16.605
All right.

01:27:20.943 --> 01:27:24.572
Now, I've narrowed the
enemy's Geass down to 22 patterns.

01:27:24.780 --> 01:27:28.409
Nonetheless, if I run out
of moves first, it's all over.

01:27:28.617 --> 01:27:31.036
Seventeen--no, 16...

01:27:31.245 --> 01:27:33.998
Twelve... I still haven't figured it out.

01:27:34.206 --> 01:27:38.836
Eight. Good, that eliminates the leads
on Forgnar. Can we still hold out?

01:27:39.044 --> 01:27:43.466
Three. No more advisers.
The enemy is Shamna. But still...

01:27:43.674 --> 01:27:46.260
Two. It's no use. I'm all out of moves.

01:27:46.469 --> 01:27:48.721
| don't have the conclusive evidence
that will keep Nunnally safe.

01:27:49.722 --> 01:27:53.851
The last one is a coin toss.
What a miserable turn of events!

01:28:01.859 --> 01:28:03.903
At last, my wish--

01:28:21.170 --> 01:28:24.715
You died again, didn't you?

01:28:27.051 --> 01:28:29.553
Nunnally, if I connect
one more time, I'm sure...

01:28:29.762 --> 01:28:32.556
| won't allow that.

01:28:32.765 --> 01:28:35.267
Are you trying to gain access to Cs' World?

01:28:35.476 --> 01:28:36.811
Your face...

01:28:38.312 --> 01:28:41.357
You're the treacherous Emperor Lelouch?

01:28:41.565 --> 01:28:45.486
| see. So that's what's going on.

01:28:45.694 --> 01:28:49.698
Fate is amusing. To think that
| would come face to face here

01:28:49.907 --> 01:28:52.535
with the reason why I had to lay this plan...

01:28:52.743 --> 01:28:57.248
Is it true that the Black Knights
will be landing in four hours?

01:28:57.456 --> 01:28:58.290
Yes.

01:28:58.499 --> 01:28:59.625
| see.

01:28:59.834 --> 01:29:04.421
Shamna, do you know
why I nearly conquered the world?

01:29:04.630 --> 01:29:05.297
Who cares?

01:29:05.506 --> 01:29:09.552
I'm sure you must know,
since you possess the same Geass as me.

01:29:10.886 --> 01:29:16.183
| was surprised. Imagine,
someone having the same Geass as I had.

01:29:16.392 --> 01:29:20.771
This is going to take a while.
Would you mind serving us some mint tea?

01:29:20.980 --> 01:29:24.567
Oh, not very good at that? I'm sorry.

01:29:24.775 --> 01:29:27.903
"The same as mine"? You mean...

01:29:28.112 --> 01:29:32.324
Take it easy. There are any number
of ways he could have learned that.

01:29:32.533 --> 01:29:36.829
But the fact remains that
he has me cornered to this extent.

01:29:37.037 --> 01:29:42.418
Is this the first time
he and I have spoken? Or...?

01:29:42.626 --> 01:29:46.922
What's the matter?
You're free to use your Geass.

01:29:47.131 --> 01:29:48.883
Well, what will it be, Shamna?

01:29:49.091 --> 01:29:53.596
Insolent fool. Why don't
you show me your power first?

01:29:55.681 --> 01:29:58.767
Don't kill him! You must not kill this man!

01:29:58.976 --> 01:30:02.313
Good! Now all of the
conditions have been cleared!

01:30:07.568 --> 01:30:14.033
You tricked me! You do not have
the same Geass that I do! You coward!

01:30:14.241 --> 01:30:18.287
Hmph, what I wanted to know is what
your power was and how to activate it.

01:30:18.495 --> 01:30:19.538
Astonishing.

01:30:19.747 --> 01:30:22.416
You have the power to go
back through time with your death.

01:30:22.625 --> 01:30:26.879
Are you using Nunnally to try
to freely choose the time you go back?

01:30:27.087 --> 01:30:31.300
Tell me, Lelouch, don't you have
any past that you wish to do over?

01:30:31.508 --> 01:30:35.512
With my Geass of unlimited rebirth,
you could change the past.

01:30:35.721 --> 01:30:37.514
There would be no need for you to
be branded the treacherous emperor

01:30:37.723 --> 01:30:41.310
and forced to leave this world.
If you join forces with me now...

01:30:41.518 --> 01:30:44.104
Don't deny me.

01:30:44.313 --> 01:30:49.693
Pain, sorrow, regret--
It's because of them that I became who I am.

01:30:49.902 --> 01:30:51.987
Do not take my scars from me.

01:30:52.196 --> 01:30:55.157
Don't you want a better future?

01:30:55.366 --> 01:30:58.160
The future is the sum of many people.

01:30:58.369 --> 01:31:01.205
There will be mistakes
and failures, to be sure.

01:31:01.413 --> 01:31:02.748
The same is true of this country.

01:31:02.957 --> 01:31:04.583
|I am...

01:31:05.626 --> 01:31:06.919
...right!

01:31:07.127 --> 01:31:10.339
No, you are not. You are mistaken, Shamna.

01:31:10.547 --> 01:31:14.760
This is not the path a ruler should go down.

01:31:14.969 --> 01:31:19.431
Then what will you do? Kill me? Me, Shamna?

01:31:19.640 --> 01:31:23.769
No. You're going to go to sleep. Forevermore!

01:31:23.978 --> 01:31:25.604
Sleep?

01:31:37.449 --> 01:31:39.118
Are you sure it's okay to leave her like this?

01:31:39.326 --> 01:31:41.120
From what I read in the construction orders,

01:31:41.328 --> 01:31:44.081
she can go back through
time less than nine hours.

01:31:44.289 --> 01:31:48.043
So we're going to blow
this place up ten hours from now.

01:31:48.252 --> 01:31:50.295
If she does go back
through time using her Geass,

01:31:50.504 --> 01:31:53.132
she'll be asleep and unable to do anything.

01:31:56.635 --> 01:32:00.556
What's going on? Why can't I contact big sister?
Where are the prophecies?!

01:32:00.764 --> 01:32:04.560
Contact with the temple
itself has been cut off, and--

01:32:05.519 --> 01:32:06.895
Something's wrong with the transmission.

01:32:07.104 --> 01:32:10.274
The backups are locked out.
Hey, do you read me?!

01:32:10.482 --> 01:32:12.234
My name is Zero.

01:32:12.443 --> 01:32:16.822
The mission succeeded!
Nunnally is in our hands!

01:32:17.031 --> 01:32:18.282
That's a patent lie.

01:32:18.490 --> 01:32:23.412
To my allies, retreat from the battle.
The mission succeeded!

01:32:23.620 --> 01:32:25.456
You are free to abandon your Knightmares.

01:32:25.664 --> 01:32:28.250
All personnel, coordinate accordingly at once.

01:32:28.459 --> 01:32:31.754
This will be your last order from Zero.

01:32:31.962 --> 01:32:34.298
Live on. That is everything!

01:32:34.506 --> 01:32:36.925
Let's see, attitude control, attitude control...

01:32:37.134 --> 01:32:39.011
Dr. Lloyd, how's the bleeding?

01:32:39.219 --> 01:32:41.805
It's stopped. She just needs a transfusion now.

01:32:42.014 --> 01:32:46.935
Blaze luminous, was it called?
Once you run out of energy, you're done for!

01:32:47.144 --> 01:32:50.522
Damn that Zero.
It was a disinformation campaign.

01:32:50.731 --> 01:32:53.859
All personnel, apprehend
all terrorists in your sectors.

01:32:54.068 --> 01:32:57.321
| want them dead or alive!
We will be the ones who prevail!

01:32:58.197 --> 01:33:02.367
Guilford, I'm charging the castle,
even if I have to do it alone.

01:33:02.576 --> 01:33:03.410
You can't!

01:33:03.619 --> 01:33:07.247
| just have to beat them.
If I don't, I'll at least be a decoy.

01:33:07.456 --> 01:33:09.750
We will accompany you.

01:33:09.958 --> 01:33:11.710
Suit yourselves.

01:33:11.919 --> 01:33:13.212
Let's go!

01:33:16.090 --> 01:33:17.633
What is going on here?

01:33:17.841 --> 01:33:20.385
Big sister, I'm coming back now.

01:33:27.601 --> 01:33:32.981
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry,
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

01:33:33.190 --> 01:33:36.360
There! I apologized my brains out,
now let's do this!

01:33:44.618 --> 01:33:49.123
Shanti, I'm sorry. Your Frame
Coat is not cut out for a brawl.

01:33:50.666 --> 01:33:56.421
Being lighter just means
that your guard isn't as high, either!

01:34:02.803 --> 01:34:06.598
That thing has a counter-Knightmare
mode they were hiding?

01:34:18.318 --> 01:34:19.736
| can do this.

01:34:41.216 --> 01:34:42.676
Hey, Nunnally?

01:34:42.885 --> 01:34:46.388
Don't tell me her consciousness is in Cs' World!

01:34:46.597 --> 01:34:49.141
The gateway under the
prison has been destroyed.

01:34:51.310 --> 01:34:55.105
We have no choice but to use
the gateway that Shamna built.

01:35:05.908 --> 01:35:08.702
| tracked you down, you terrorists!

01:35:08.911 --> 01:35:11.455
I'm impressed you
managed to make it this far

01:35:11.663 --> 01:35:15.334
in an unarmed Knightmare,
while under my Geass.

01:35:15.542 --> 01:35:19.504
However, it ended up being all for nothing--

01:35:24.218 --> 01:35:26.511
Damn it all...

01:35:26.720 --> 01:35:29.848
The energy filler...

01:35:39.775 --> 01:35:41.526
Witch of Britannia...

01:35:41.735 --> 01:35:43.946
| will surround you and crush you.

01:35:44.154 --> 01:35:46.406
The only one I want is Forgnar.

01:35:46.615 --> 01:35:48.116
Understood.

01:35:56.041 --> 01:35:57.000
She broke through?!

01:35:57.209 --> 01:36:01.296
Forgnar! Show me what you're made of!

01:36:13.809 --> 01:36:17.980
It's over for you, Forgnar!
If you value your life, stand down!

01:36:18.188 --> 01:36:22.818
Attention, all forces: blast the
Witch of Britannia, and me along with her!

01:36:33.996 --> 01:36:36.039
| could have done this alone, you know.

01:36:36.248 --> 01:36:38.292
| couldn't have that.

01:36:38.500 --> 01:36:41.878
Then go over there. That's where Nunnally is.

01:36:42.087 --> 01:36:43.171
What about you?

01:36:43.380 --> 01:36:45.340
There's something I need to check.

01:36:45.549 --> 01:36:49.970
| need to get back first, and move
your bodies some place safe, too.

01:37:01.064 --> 01:37:05.736
| wonder, how much time has
passed since you all left the Order,

01:37:05.944 --> 01:37:08.739
Shamna the Divine?

01:37:08.947 --> 01:37:11.408
It's nice to meet you, Master C.C.

01:37:11.616 --> 01:37:14.202
Did you fail to make it?

01:37:14.411 --> 01:37:18.081
Perhaps not. Mine was
originally a look-ahead Geass,

01:37:18.290 --> 01:37:20.667
which changed to become the power it is now.

01:37:20.876 --> 01:37:23.837
A result of your reason becoming corrupted.

01:37:24.046 --> 01:37:27.090
Since I couldn't go anywhere,
| embraced a dream.

01:37:27.299 --> 01:37:29.343
To remake the world of men.

01:37:30.635 --> 01:37:35.057
In my land, fighting is the
only thing that brings in money.

01:37:35.265 --> 01:37:37.851
Lelouch's peace backed us against a wall.

01:37:38.060 --> 01:37:41.396
Ironic, isn't it? Because of Lelouch,

01:37:41.605 --> 01:37:45.567
you will now wander for
eternity between life and death.

01:37:45.776 --> 01:37:49.404
What will you do?
I'm willing to send you along.

01:37:49.613 --> 01:37:51.365
In here...

01:37:51.573 --> 01:37:56.078
In here, I can meet with the
lives of those who were lost for me.

01:37:56.286 --> 01:37:58.163
Someday, that will be Shalio.

01:37:59.414 --> 01:38:05.712
Shalio, how many times have you
been hurt and lost your life for me?

01:38:07.506 --> 01:38:13.428
If that is your desire, I can do nothing,
but don't leave any regrets.

01:38:19.726 --> 01:38:21.978
Got it! From this position...!

01:38:25.607 --> 01:38:28.026
Hey, Rashid! Samsa! José!

01:38:29.694 --> 01:38:33.198
Which means that if I bring
her down, more money for me!

01:38:33.407 --> 01:38:38.036
My Batalalan Du is second
to none when it comes to hardness!

01:38:38.245 --> 01:38:41.748
| can figure out my attack
while I'm withstanding yours!

01:38:47.254 --> 01:38:48.380
Suzaku?

01:38:48.588 --> 01:38:50.549
He's got a problem enemy over there, too.

01:38:51.508 --> 01:38:55.720
Big sister! Your prophecy!
How do I beat this guy?!

01:39:02.894 --> 01:39:08.817
Even without a prophecy...
for big sister... for the people...

01:39:09.025 --> 01:39:10.485
| will fight!

01:39:10.694 --> 01:39:17.325
Nagid Shu Mane, one more time.
You can keep up, right, body of mine?!

01:39:30.338 --> 01:39:34.092
Hey, are you sure you want
to get this rough with me?!

01:39:34.301 --> 01:39:36.720
You're going to wind up
spending all your energy.

01:39:36.928 --> 01:39:40.640
Besides, you'll never get through
my armor by just ducking me!

01:39:40.849 --> 01:39:44.352
You're right. That's why
I'm going to quit ducking.

01:39:46.438 --> 01:39:47.564
Buffoon!

01:39:47.772 --> 01:39:49.316
Yeah, yeah.

01:39:49.524 --> 01:39:53.653
You know, you're strong. Honestly.

01:40:00.076 --> 01:40:05.707
Screw this! The prophecy!
What happened to the unbeatable prophecy?!

01:40:05.916 --> 01:40:09.586
My... money!

01:40:15.509 --> 01:40:16.301
What is that?

01:40:16.510 --> 01:40:19.804
| don't know. I can only guess
they're the regrets of lots of people.

01:40:26.561 --> 01:40:28.688
| have to at least save you, Nunnally!

01:40:28.897 --> 01:40:29.898
No!

01:40:30.106 --> 01:40:33.485
| haven't been able to tell
you anything yet, big brother!

01:40:33.693 --> 01:40:35.946
Not yet...!

01:40:40.825 --> 01:40:43.328
What is this? Is Zero still asleep?

01:40:43.537 --> 01:40:46.498
I'm sure he's exhausted. Wait a little longer.

01:40:46.706 --> 01:40:50.502
We're the ones who are exhausted,
after carrying them back here.

01:40:50.710 --> 01:40:54.089
What are you doing?
Hurry up and come back.

01:40:56.466 --> 01:41:01.930
All the minds who make up this space,
I, Lelouch Lamperouge, command you!

01:41:02.138 --> 01:41:04.015
You will...

01:41:07.018 --> 01:41:08.353
Nunnally...

01:41:08.562 --> 01:41:10.355
Y-Yes, big brother?

01:41:10.564 --> 01:41:14.359
My Geass is my sin to bear. Which is why...

01:41:28.832 --> 01:41:33.587
Oh, so we're to be saved by you once again?

01:41:48.143 --> 01:41:51.062
Why...? Why...?

01:41:51.271 --> 01:41:53.481
Why?!

01:42:07.412 --> 01:42:10.457
Now you will pay for your
crime of snatching away Nunnally

01:42:10.665 --> 01:42:11.916
and disrupting the peace!

01:42:12.125 --> 01:42:14.336
Crime?! Crime, you say?!

01:42:14.544 --> 01:42:18.381
What else does Zilkhstan
have besides fighting?!

01:42:18.590 --> 01:42:20.925
Give up. This fight is over.

01:42:21.134 --> 01:42:25.013
It's not over! For the sake of big sister,
who bears the weight of this land,

01:42:25.221 --> 01:42:28.642
| will become the mightiest warrior!

01:42:28.850 --> 01:42:29.601
Is he...?

01:42:29.809 --> 01:42:32.354
A stalemate is not the same as a loss!

01:42:37.108 --> 01:42:43.156
How many people have suffered
to allow me to maintain my body?

01:42:43.365 --> 01:42:47.911
If I lose now, then for what reason have I...?

01:42:48.119 --> 01:42:54.918
Tell me, big sister.
What should I have done?

01:42:55.126 --> 01:42:58.421
Big sister, I can see light...

01:43:15.021 --> 01:43:19.317
Why? Why can't I reach
Princess Shamna or King Shalio?

01:43:19.526 --> 01:43:21.403
Men! What are you waiting for?!

01:43:21.611 --> 01:43:24.364
| thought I ordered you
to shoot us, including myself!

01:43:24.572 --> 01:43:25.573
Why aren't you shooting?!

01:43:25.782 --> 01:43:27.701
Stop.

01:43:27.909 --> 01:43:32.038
Your soldiers know
that you, Bolvona Forgnar,

01:43:32.247 --> 01:43:35.083
are Zilkhstan's last bulwark.

01:43:37.877 --> 01:43:41.172
Thus ends the prophecy.

01:43:47.220 --> 01:43:48.179
We have a news bulletin

01:43:48.388 --> 01:43:51.141
concerning the abduction of
WHA Honorary Consultant Nunnally,

01:43:51.349 --> 01:43:53.977
otherwise known as the
"Puzzlement in Hashvess."

01:43:54.185 --> 01:43:58.773
Early this morning, a special squad led by
General Cornelia succeeded in rescuing her.

01:43:58.982 --> 01:44:00.984
The honorary consultant
is said to be unharmed.

01:44:01.192 --> 01:44:04.446
It looks like not even
the prophecies of that nation,

01:44:04.654 --> 01:44:07.657
which vexed all others,
could work against him.

01:44:14.706 --> 01:44:18.126
It looks like the landing by the
Black Knights is getting underway.

01:44:18.334 --> 01:44:21.421
Well, now you can get
some proper treatment.

01:44:21.629 --> 01:44:25.967
I'm sorry you missed out
on getting the credit.

01:44:26.176 --> 01:44:30.597
Oh, no, we might be able to go
to another war-torn region now.

01:44:30.805 --> 01:44:34.684
It feels like congratulations are in order.

01:44:40.815 --> 01:44:42.817
--What was that?!
--Where is Princess Shamna?!

01:44:54.871 --> 01:44:57.165
Big brother! Thank goodness.

01:44:57.373 --> 01:44:59.876
What, is he finally awake?

01:45:00.084 --> 01:45:02.712
Perfect timing. Things are incredible outside.

01:45:02.921 --> 01:45:04.380
Huh?

01:45:09.928 --> 01:45:11.304
What is this?

01:45:11.513 --> 01:45:14.474
You made it back, Lelouch.

01:45:41.918 --> 01:45:44.254
See you, Suzaku. You can have that back.

01:45:44.462 --> 01:45:45.672
But...

01:45:45.880 --> 01:45:49.926
Like I said, I was only temporary.
| can't stay here.

01:45:50.134 --> 01:45:51.302
Big brother...

01:45:52.554 --> 01:45:54.472
Hmm? What is it?

01:45:54.681 --> 01:45:58.852
I've... I've regretted
some things for a long time.

01:45:59.060 --> 01:46:03.940
That I didn't realize your true intentions.
That I ever doubted you.

01:46:04.148 --> 01:46:05.775
Don't worry about that.

01:46:05.984 --> 01:46:07.026
Big brother,

01:46:07.235 --> 01:46:10.780
let's live together!
Once again, like we used to!

01:46:10.989 --> 01:46:16.327
You don't have to carry your guilt by yourself.
I'm just as guilty, after all!

01:46:19.622 --> 01:46:22.125
Thanks, Nunnally.

01:46:47.817 --> 01:46:48.776
You forgot something.

01:46:48.985 --> 01:46:51.404
O-Oh, thanks.

01:46:51.613 --> 01:46:53.948
What's this? You're leaving all alone?

01:46:54.157 --> 01:46:59.245
| can't be a part of any public group,
but I'll stop in every so often.

01:47:03.625 --> 01:47:06.419
There are already so many
people fleeing the country.

01:47:06.628 --> 01:47:09.714
Tell me, we did the right thing, didn't we?

01:47:09.923 --> 01:47:14.594
That... is something history will decide.

01:47:14.802 --> 01:47:18.640
All we can do is what we believe
to be right, as best we can.

01:47:24.687 --> 01:47:28.816
C.C.! Hey, wait up, C.C.!

01:47:33.071 --> 01:47:34.822
You haven't changed at all in that regard.

01:47:35.031 --> 01:47:38.618
It's not that...! You just...
left without... saying anything...

01:47:38.826 --> 01:47:41.496
So, what is it? Did I forget something?

01:47:41.704 --> 01:47:42.956
I'm coming... with you...

01:47:43.164 --> 01:47:45.083
Huh? What about Nunnally?

01:47:45.291 --> 01:47:49.671
Nunnally... Nunnally can
live just fine on her own now.

01:47:49.879 --> 01:47:52.757
If I'm around, I'll just be in her way.

01:47:56.886 --> 01:47:58.930
Then there are other options, right?

01:47:59.138 --> 01:48:02.266
You could go and pay a visit
to Shirley or Kaguya, couldn't you?

01:48:02.475 --> 01:48:07.355
| am planning to contact Shirley at some point,
but if I go now, it will cause a huge scene.

01:48:07.563 --> 01:48:12.110
Hmph, if you're looking for someone
to wait on you, look somewhere else.

01:48:12.318 --> 01:48:16.614
I'm on my way to track down the
Geass fragments that Shamna left behind.

01:48:16.823 --> 01:48:17.991
What about you?!

01:48:18.199 --> 01:48:20.743
You bring someone back to life without
asking, and now you're neglecting them?

01:48:20.952 --> 01:48:22.912
Hmph, such a self-centered woman!

01:48:23.121 --> 01:48:27.125
You didn't know that? Yes, I am self-centered.

01:48:27.333 --> 01:48:29.877
Besides, what are you going
to do about your name?

01:48:30.086 --> 01:48:32.296
If word gets out, it's going to be a huge deal.

01:48:32.505 --> 01:48:37.343
My name? Well, taking it
from Lelouch Lamperouge,

01:48:37.552 --> 01:48:40.263
how does "L.L." sound?

01:48:40.471 --> 01:48:41.806
Huh?

01:48:42.015 --> 01:48:43.516
No good?

01:49:09.917 --> 01:49:19.510
I heard your voice on endless nights

01:49:19.719 --> 01:49:28.561
You pervaded the mornings when I awoke

01:49:28.770 --> 01:49:33.524
There were times when I stood paralyzed

01:49:33.733 --> 01:49:38.446
by the multitude of things I'd lost

01:49:38.654 --> 01:49:47.163
Nonetheless, rising back on my feet

01:49:47.371 --> 01:49:53.252
was the promise I made to you

01:49:53.461 --> 01:49:58.257
Revive! Everything I've stumbled across

01:49:58.466 --> 01:50:03.221
Revive! Lives on within my heartbeat

01:50:03.429 --> 01:50:11.395
Revive, revive, revive!
I won't waver anymore

01:50:13.356 --> 01:50:18.069
Revive! The feelings that connect us (connect us)

01:50:18.277 --> 01:50:23.032
Revive! Ignite a flame that
can't be shaken (can't be shaken)

01:50:23.241 --> 01:50:32.208
Revive, revive, revive!
Coming back to life now

01:50:33.167 --> 01:50:37.880
Revive! So here you are again today

01:50:38.089 --> 01:50:42.718
Revive! I sing this song to you

01:50:42.927 --> 01:50:51.435
Revive, revive, revive! An indelible,

01:50:51.644 --> 01:50:53.521
eternal Revive

01:50:53.729 --> 01:50:55.857
We are one and we are strong!

01:50:56.065 --> 01:50:58.526
No one can stop us

01:50:58.734 --> 01:51:00.736
We are one and we are strong!

01:51:00.945 --> 01:51:02.989
Awakened at last

01:51:03.197 --> 01:51:08.411
Oh, here we stand!

01:51:08.619 --> 01:51:13.249
Because of our love

01:51:15.168 --> 01:51:19.964
Revive! Before these thousands of stars,

01:51:20.173 --> 01:51:24.802
Revive! I solemnly pledge to you now

01:51:25.011 --> 01:51:33.436
Revive, revive, revive!
I won't waver anymore

01:51:33.644 --> 01:51:39.358
Believe me, Revive!

01:51:44.822 --> 01:51:53.372
Revive, revive, revive! I've finally realized

01:51:54.749 --> 01:51:59.420
Revive! Everything I've stumbled across

01:51:59.629 --> 01:52:04.383
Revive! Lives on within my heartbeat

01:52:04.592 --> 01:52:13.184
Revive, revive, revive!
Now, stretch out your hand

01:52:13.392 --> 01:52:15.603
and Revive for tomorrow

01:52:20.608 --> 01:52:25.238
You don't say.
By having Geass, you're able to live.

01:52:25.446 --> 01:52:29.116
However, the same power that
allows you to live in the world of men

01:52:29.325 --> 01:52:32.787
forces you to live by
different principles than man's.

01:52:32.995 --> 01:52:38.584
A different logic.
A different time. A different life.

01:52:38.793 --> 01:52:42.672
The king's power may isolate you.

01:52:42.880 --> 01:52:47.176
We'll take Geass from those
who don't have the resolve. However,

01:52:47.385 --> 01:52:49.387
if they do have the resolve...
